{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BDfJyY4NuXyXMXZqPpkoXG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'CIVO mechanism confirmed in DMC locomotion (Walker Walk + Cheetah\n2\t  Run) with gradient-level causal evidence (Full-SGS NVE=1.00×). NVE>1.5x threshold\n3\t  achieves perfect separation in Walker (4/4) and near-perfect in Cheetah (5/6 or\n4\t  6/6). Cartpole Swingup results are ''consistent with but do not independently confirm''\n5\t  the mechanism — NVE stays in gray zone or only borderline exceeds threshold, preventing\n6\t  a clean third-environment confirmation. Scope primary findings to RSSM + proprioceptive\n7\t  DMC locomotion; discuss Cartpole as preliminary extension showing degradation without\n8\t  unambiguous CIVO signature. Weaken ''generalizes across environments'' to ''generalizes\n9\t  within DMC locomotion; further investigation needed for non-locomotion/visual domains''.\n10\t  Pathway B (non-CIVO policy instability from trained dt_emb) remains under-characterized\n11\t  — 2/4 seeds collapse across 008e_v3, mechanism identified (eval-driven, entropy↑)\n12\t  but causal chain incomplete. Paper publishable at CoRL as strong 2-environment mechanistic\n13\t  diagnosis + practical warning + novel TAWM contrast (MPC success vs imagination\n14\t  failure).\n15\t\n16\t  '\n17\timagined_experiments:\n18\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n19\t  plan_id: plan_011\n20\t  description: Replicate CIVO collapse with 2 additional seeds for 008d (subsample\n21\t    ON + trained dt_emb + H=8)\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    seed1_009e:\n24\t      eval_trajectory:\n25\t        25K: 167\n26\t        35K: 146\n27\t        45K: 141\n28\t        55K: 83\n29\t        65K: 250\n30\t        75K: 178\n31\t        85K: 202\n32\t        95K: 133\n33\t        105K: 131\n34\t      nve_trajectory:\n35\t        25K: 1.78\n36\t        35K: 1.71\n37\t        45K: 2.09\n38\t        55K: 4.12\n39\t        65K: 1.23\n40\t        75K: 1.48\n41\t        85K: 1.15\n42\t        95K: 1.73\n43\t        105K: 1.57\n44\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n45\t      collapse: true\n46\t      collapse_onset_step: 25K\n47\t      peak_nve: 4.12\n48\t      final_eval: 131\n49\t    seed2_009b:\n50\t      eval_trajectory:\n51\t        25K: 141\n52\t        35K: 164\n53\t        45K: 141\n54\t        55K: 172\n55\t        65K: 209\n56\t        75K: 197\n57\t        85K: 236\n58\t        95K: 279\n59\t        105K: 268\n60\t      nve_trajectory:\n61\t        25K: 2.05\n62\t        35K: 1.24\n63\t        45K: 1.62\n64\t        55K: 1.41\n65\t        65K: 0.94\n66\t        75K: 0.66\n67\t        85K: 0.51\n68\t        95K: 0.43\n69\t        105K: 0.38\n70\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n71\t      collapse: false\n72\t      value_self_correction: true\n73\t      value_peak: 110.9\n74\t      value_peak_step: 65K\n75\t      final_eval: 268\n76\t    combined:\n77\t      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 2/2\n78\t      collapse_rate: 1/2\n79\t      independent_collapse_rate: 0.5\n80\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下，Walker Walk 中 trained dt_emb 可靠触发 nve>1.5x（2/2 seeds\n81\t    均超阈值）， 但崩溃是随机的（1/2）。Seed 1 的 RSSM 在 dt=2 处产生系统性 reward 偏差（reward gap 2.78x）， trained\n82\t    dt_emb 让 critic 精确利用这个偏差，形成 value→actor→data→value 正反馈。Seed 2 同样 触发 nve>1.5x，但早期训练随机性（初始化、数据采样顺序）使得过度估计未能在连续\n83\t    3 个 checkpoint 持续超过 1.5x，actor 仍能从 real returns 获得纠正梯度，value 自修正。这与 Henderson\n84\t    et al. 2018 和 Bjorck et al. 2022 的早期随机性决定训练轨迹一致。\n85\t\n86\t    '\n87\t  tables:\n88\t  - name: NVE threshold classification (Walker trained dt_emb)\n89\t    data: '| Seed | nve>1.5x at 35K+ | Collapse | Peak NVE | Sustained >1.5x |\n90\t\n91\t      |------|------------------|----------|----------|-----------------|\n92\t\n93\t      | 0 (008d) | ✓ (1.71x@35K) | ✓ | 4.12x | 3 checkpoints |\n94\t\n95\t      | 1 (009e) | ✓ (1.71x@35K) | ✓ | 4.12x | 3 checkpoints |\n96\t\n97\t      | 2 (009b) | ✓ (1.62x@45K) | ✗ | 2.05x | 1 checkpoint |\n98\t\n99\t      '\n100\t  figures_description:\n101\t  - 'Learning curves: 008d seed 0+1 (collapse) vs 009b seed 2 (self-correction), overlaid\n102\t    with baseline'\n103\t  - 'NVE trajectories: 3 seeds showing all exceed 1.5x but diverge in persistence'\n104\t  analysis: 'nve>1.5x 阈值在 trained dt_emb 条件下达到 3/3（含 seed 0）完美检出率。崩溃概率 2/3 （seed 0\n105\t    和 seed 1 崩溃，seed 2 自修正）。关键发现：sustained nve>1.5x（连续 3+ checkpoints）是区分崩溃 vs 自修正的第二道门。论文报告\n106\t    nve>1.5x 为 necessary condition， temporal persistence 为 collapse gate。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0) seeds 1-2\n110\t  plan_id: plan_012\n111\t  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 additional seeds (subsample\n112\t    ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + H=8)\n113\t  expected_results:\n114\t    seed1_009f:\n115\t      eval_trajectory:\n116\t        25K: 185\n117\t        35K: 210\n118\t        45K: 195\n119\t        55K: 230\n120\t        65K: 310\n121\t        75K: 280\n122\t        85K: 350\n123\t        95K: 310\n124\t        105K: 420\n125\t      nve_trajectory:\n126\t        25K: 0.95\n127\t        35K: 0.75\n128\t        45K: 0.8\n129\t        55K: 0.88\n130\t        65K: 0.45\n131\t        75K: 0.5\n132\t        85K: 0.55\n133\t        95K: 0.48\n134\t        105K: 0.35\n135\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n136\t      collapse: false\n137\t      final_eval: 420\n138\t      vs_baseline_105K: -54.1%\n139\t    seed2_009c:\n140\t      eval_trajectory:\n141\t        25K: 169\n142\t        35K: 179\n143\t        45K: 211\n144\t        55K: 239\n145\t        65K: 244\n146\t        75K: 359\n147\t        85K: 227\n148\t        95K: 191\n149\t        105K: 148\n150\t      nve_trajectory:\n151\t        25K: 1.26\n152\t        35K: 0.79\n153\t        45K: 0.72\n154\t        55K: 0.66\n155\t        65K: 0.53\n156\t        75K: 0.33\n157\t        85K: 0.6\n158\t        95K: 0.9\n159\t        105K: 1.14\n160\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n161\t      collapse: false\n162\t      final_eval: 148\n163\t      vs_baseline_105K: -83.8%\n164\t      note: Decline after 75K but nve stays <1.5x; NOT delusional critic but learning\n165\t        instability without dt conditioning\n166\t    combined:\n167\t      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 0/2\n168\t      collapse_rate: 0/2\n169\t      cross_seed_consistency: Low — seed 1 recovers to 420, seed 2 declines to 148\n170\t  result_rationale: '去掉 dt_embedding 后，reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x），阻断了\n171\t    CIVO 正反馈环。两个 seed 的 nve 均未超过 1.5x（max 1.26x@25K for seed 2，属于 early-stage false\n172\t    positive zone）。但 008f 配置本身牺牲了 reward 预测质量（MAE 为 baseline 75x）， 导致跨 seed 一致性差——seed\n173\t    1 zigzag 恢复到 420（类似 seed 0 的 503），seed 2 则在 75K 后持续下降到 148。这种高方差归因于 reward head\n174\t    噪声使 actor 学习信号质量不稳定。 关键论点不变：008f 是因果控制实验证明 \"without dt_emb → no CIVO\"，不是推荐方案。\n175\t\n176\t    '\n177\t  tables:\n178\t  - name: NVE threshold classification (Walker no dt_emb)\n179\t    data: '| Seed | nve>1.5x at 35K+ | Collapse | Peak NVE (35K+) | Final eval |\n180\t\n181\t      |------|------------------|----------|-----------------|------------|\n182\t\n183\t      | 0 (008f) | ✗ (0.97x) | ✗ | 0.97x | 503 |\n184\t\n185\t      | 1 (009f) | ✗ (0.88x) | ✗ | 0.88x | 420 |\n186\t\n187\t      | 2 (009c) | ✗ (1.14x) | ✗ | 1.14x | 148 |\n188\t\n189\t      '\n190\t  figures_description:\n191\t  - 'NVE trajectories: 3 seeds all below 1.5x, contrasted with 008d 3 seeds all above\n192\t    1.5x'\n193\t  analysis: 'Combined with plan_011: NVE>1.5x threshold achieves 6/6 perfect classification\n194\t    in Walker (3/3 trained exceed, 3/3 no-dt-emb below). 008f seed 2 的 nve=1.14x@105K\n195\t    是最接近阈值的 case，但仍有 24% margin。论文中可报告 008f 跨 seed 高方差（148-503）作为 \"因果控制的代价\"， 与 008e_v3\n196\t    seed 1 (869.9) 对比突出后者更实用。\n197\t\n198\t    '\n199\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n200\t  plan_id: plan_013\n201\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression and zigzag recovery with 2 additional\n202\t    seeds (subsample OFF + untrained dt_emb + H=15)\n203\t  expected_results:\n204\t    seed1:\n205\t      eval_trajectory:\n206\t        35K: 460\n207\t        45K: 520\n208\t        55K: 440\n209\t        65K: 570\n210\t        75K: 500\n211\t        85K: 560\n212\t        95K: 610\n213\t        105K: 710\n214\t      nve_trajectory:\n215\t        55K: 0.85\n216\t        65K: 0.62\n217\t        75K: 0.7\n218\t        85K: 0.65\n219\t        95K: 0.72\n220\t        105K: 0.55\n221\t      final_eval: 710\n222\t      vs_baseline_105K: -22.5%\n223\t      zigzag_recovery: true\n224\t      n_recovery_cycles: 2\n225\t    seed2:\n226\t      eval_trajectory:\n227\t        35K: 420\n228\t        45K: 480\n229\t        55K: 410\n230\t        65K: 530\n231\t        75K: 450\n232\t        85K: 520\n233\t        95K: 550\n234\t        105K: 660\n235\t      nve_trajectory:\n236\t        55K: 0.8\n237\t        65K: 0.58\n238\t        75K: 0.68\n239\t        85K: 0.63\n240\t        95K: 0.7\n241\t        105K: 0.52\n242\t      final_eval: 660\n243\t      vs_baseline_105K: -27.9%\n244\t      zigzag_recovery: true\n245\t      n_recovery_cycles: 2\n246\t    combined:\n247\t      iqm_105K: 716\n248\t      iqm_vs_baseline: -21.8%\n249\t      nve_range_105K:\n250\t      - 0.52\n251\t      - 0.59\n252\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n253\t  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb 使 value function 无法利用精确的 dt>1 预测信息——dt_embedding\n254\t    是随机固定的， 对 critic 来说 dt=1 和 dt=2 的 conditioning 没有语义区分。这从源头阻断了 CIVO 正反馈。 Median\n255\t    档位下，两个新 seed 复现 seed 0 的 zigzag recovery 模式（V-shaped dips + recoveries）， 但绝对水平略低于\n256\t    seed 0（710, 660 vs 778）——这是 untrained dt_emb 配置的典型高方差特征。 nve 在所有 seed 中均被压制在 0.52-0.93x\n257\t    range，随时间进一步远离 baseline（结构性抑制， 非暂时延迟）。关键差异：这些 seed 的 recovery cycles 可能在 timing\n258\t    上不同步，但 pattern （dip → recovery → dip → higher recovery）一致，说明 zigzag 是配置的内在特征而非随机波动。\n259\t\n260\t    '\n261\t  tables:\n262\t  - name: 008a cross-seed summary\n263\t    data: '| Seed | eval@105K | nve@105K | V-recoveries | vs baseline |\n264\t\n265\t      |------|-----------|----------|--------------|-------------|\n266\t\n267\t      | 0    | 778       | 0.59x    | 2 cycles     | -15.1%      |\n268\t\n269\t      | 1    | 710       | 0.55x    | 2 cycles     | -22.5%      |\n270\t\n271\t      | 2    | 660       | 0.52x    | 2 cycles     | -27.9%      |\n272\t\n273\t      | IQM  | 716       | 0.55x    | —            | -21.8%      |\n274\t\n275\t      '\n276\t  figures_description:\n277\t  - 3-seed learning curves with shaded IQM confidence band, showing consistent zigzag\n278\t    pattern\n279\t  - 'NVE trajectories: all 3 seeds consistently below 1.0x and declining'\n280\t  analysis: '3-seed 数据确认 untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 是 robust 的（0/3 collapse，nve\n281\t    range 0.52-0.59x@105K）。IQM 716 (78% baseline) 低于 seed 0 的 778 (85%)，报告时使用 IQM\n282\t    + 95% CI 而非 best seed。C3 claim strength 保持 Strong。\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imag) seeds 1-2\n286\t  plan_id: plan_014\n287\t  description: Multi-seed validation of trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imagination\n288\t    + H=15\n289\t  expected_results:\n290\t    seed1_s1:\n291\t      eval_trajectory:\n292\t        25K: 156\n293\t        35K: 276\n294\t        45K: 382\n295\t        55K: 487\n296\t        65K: 581\n297\t        75K: 574\n298\t        85K: 657\n299\t        95K: 852\n300\t        105K: 870\n301\t      nve_trajectory:\n302\t        35K: 0.94\n303\t        45K: 0.88\n304\t        55K: 0.87\n305\t        65K: 0.72\n306\t        75K: 0.73\n307\t        85K: 0.76\n308\t        95K: 0.75\n309\t        105K: 0.8\n310\t      collapse: false\n311\t      final_eval: 870\n312\t      vs_baseline_105K: -5.0%\n313\t      pathway: healthy\n314\t    seed2_s2:\n315\t      eval_trajectory:\n316\t        25K: 212\n317\t        35K: 320\n318\t        45K: 357\n319\t        55K: 418\n320\t        65K: 435\n321\t        75K: 577\n322\t        85K: 715\n323\t        95K: 452\n324\t        105K: 137\n325\t      nve_trajectory:\n326\t        35K: 1.03\n327\t        45K: 1.06\n328\t        55K: 1.02\n329\t        65K: 0.9\n330\t        75K: 0.66\n331\t        85K: 0.68\n332\t        95K: 1.34\n333\t        105K: 3.78\n334\t      collapse: true\n335\t      collapse_onset: 95K\n336\t      collapse_type: Pathway B (non-CIVO, eval-driven, entropy↑)\n337\t      actor_entropy_at_collapse:\n338\t        85K: -5.21\n339\t        95K: -4.53\n340\t        105K: -3.83\n341\t      final_eval: 137\n342\t      gate_dt_1_frac: 1.0\n343\t    combined:\n344\t      collapse_rate: 1/2\n345\t      pathway_A_civo: 0/2 (eliminated by dt=1 imagination)\n346\t      pathway_B_non_civo: 1/2\n347\t  result_rationale: 'dt=1 imagination 消除了 Pathway A (CIVO)——imagination rollout 中不产生\n348\t    dt>1 transitions， critic 不会在 dt>1 处累积 overestimation。但 training data 仍含 dt>1 transitions（subsample\n349\t    ON）， trained dt_emb 仍在学习 dt=1 vs dt=2 的区分。Seed 2 的崩溃走 Pathway B：eval 先崩 （715→452→137），value\n350\t    相对稳定（339→384→340），nve 被 eval 分母驱动而非 value 分子驱动。 actor_entropy 上升（-5.21→-3.83）是策略去确定化的信号，与\n351\t    CIVO 的 entropy↓ 相反。 009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定（618→596→836），排除 seed 2 固有脆弱假说。 Median\n352\t    档下 Pathway B 的确切机制未完全刻画——可能是 trained dt_emb 在 representation 层面 引入的干扰（93% 梯度来自\n353\t    observation decoders），但因果链不如 Pathway A 清晰。\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t  tables:\n357\t  - name: 008e_v3 Pathway A vs Pathway B\n358\t    data: '| Feature        | 008d s0 (Pathway A) | 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B) |\n359\t\n360\t      |----------------|---------------------|------------------------|\n361\t\n362\t      | value Δ        | +130% (60→138)      | +13% (339→384)         |\n363\t\n364\t      | eval Δ         | -43% (146→83)       | -81% (715→137)         |\n365\t\n366\t      | nve driver     | value numerator     | eval denominator       |\n367\t\n368\t      | actor_entropy  | ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)     | ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)       |\n369\t\n370\t      | dt in imag     | dt=2                | dt=1 (never violated)  |\n371\t\n372\t      '\n373\t  figures_description:\n374\t  - 'Side-by-side: 008e_v3 seed 1 (healthy) vs seed 2 (Pathway B collapse)'\n375\t  - 'Actor entropy comparison: CIVO collapse (↓) vs Pathway B collapse (↑)'\n376\t  analysis: 'C6 partially falsified：dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A 但不消除 Pathway B。崩溃率\n377\t    1/2 与 008d (1/2-2/3) 相当——dt=1 imagination 未降低总崩溃概率。论文需将 C6 从 \"practical mitigation\"\n378\t    改为 \"partial mitigation (eliminates CIVO pathway only)\"。Pathway B 作为 open question\n379\t    在 Discussion 中报告。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 + H=8\n383\t  plan_id: plan_015\n384\t  description: 'Freeze dt_embedding (requires_grad=False, random init). Diagnostic:\n385\t    is dt_emb TRAINING the necessary condition for CIVO?'\n386\t  expected_results:\n387\t    seed0:\n388\t      eval_trajectory:\n389\t        25K: 172\n390\t        35K: 202\n391\t        45K: 122\n392\t        55K: 106\n393\t        65K: 160\n394\t        75K: 80\n395\t        85K: 184\n396\t        95K: 238\n397\t        105K: 204\n398\t      nve_trajectory:\n399\t        85K: 0.47\n400\t        95K: 0.39\n401\t        105K: 0.42\n402\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: false\n403\t      collapse: false\n404\t      collapse_mechanism: gradient_starvation — actor_loss→0 due to frozen conditioning\n405\t      actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n406\t      actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n407\t      value_mean_105K: 56.2\n408\t      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n409\t      final_eval: 204\n410\t      vs_baseline_105K: -77.7%\n411\t  result_rationale: 'Frozen dt_emb 是一个不同的失败模式：dt_embedding 固定在随机值，gate 输出恒定 dt=2，\n412\t    但 embedding 永远不更新以匹配 RSSM dynamics。结果是 critic 收到的 conditioning 信号 与 state transitions\n413\t    不一致，但不会产生 CIVO 的正反馈（因为 embedding 不被训练去 exploit RSSM 的 systematic bias）。NVE 远低于\n414\t    1.0x（0.39-0.47x，critic under-estimates）， actor_loss→0 说明 value gradient 无法有效驱动\n415\t    policy improvement。这是 gradient starvation， 不是 value overestimation。 关键论点：frozen\n416\t    dt_emb 确认 CIVO 需要 dt_emb 的 TRAINING——是训练过程中 observation decoder 梯度（93%）塑造 dt_embedding\n417\t    以 exploit RSSM fidelity gap 的能力导致了 CIVO， 而非 dt_embedding 的存在本身。\n418\t\n419\t    '\n420\t  tables:\n421\t  - name: dt_emb condition × CIVO outcome (Walker 2×2 matrix)\n422\t    data: '| dt_emb state      | Config     | NVE range  | CIVO? | Outcome         |\n423\t\n424\t      |-------------------|------------|------------|-------|-----------------|\n425\t\n426\t      | Trained           | 008d       | 1.7-4.1x   | ✓     | Collapse (2/3)  |\n427\t\n428\t      | Frozen (random)   | 015b       | 0.39-0.47x | ✗     | Grad starvation |\n429\t\n430\t      | Absent (dim=0)    | 008f       | 0.30-0.97x | ✗     | Zigzag recovery |\n431\t\n432\t      | Untrained (OFF)   | 008a       | 0.52-0.93x | ✗     | Zigzag recovery |\n433\t\n434\t      '\n435\t  figures_description:\n436\t  - '4-way comparison: trained / frozen / absent / unexposed dt_emb learning curves'\n437\t  analysis: '2×2 消融矩阵闭合：只有 trained + exposed to dt>1 data 的 dt_emb 触发 CIVO。Frozen\n438\t    和 absent 都不触发，但通过不同机制失败（gradient starvation vs reward degradation）。 这强化了 C2: dt_emb\n439\t    TRAINING（而非 dt_emb 存在）是 CIVO 的 necessary condition。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n443\t  plan_id: plan_016\n444\t  description: Narrow 008e_v3 collapse rate estimate with 2 additional seeds\n445\t  expected_results:\n446\t    seed3:\n447\t      eval_trajectory:\n448\t        35K: 290\n449\t        45K: 400\n450\t        55K: 510\n451\t        65K: 590\n452\t        75K: 620\n453\t        85K: 700\n454\t        95K: 820\n455\t        105K: 845\n456\t      nve_trajectory:\n457\t        35K: 0.9\n458\t        45K: 0.85\n459\t        55K: 0.82\n460\t        65K: 0.7\n461\t        75K: 0.68\n462\t        85K: 0.72\n463\t        95K: 0.7\n464\t        105K: 0.75\n465\t      collapse: false\n466\t      pathway: healthy\n467\t      final_eval: 845\n468\t      vs_baseline_105K: -7.7%\n469\t    seed4:\n470\t      eval_trajectory:\n471\t        35K: 260\n472\t        45K: 370\n473\t        55K: 450\n474\t        65K: 530\n475\t        75K: 580\n476\t        85K: 680\n477\t        95K: 420\n478\t        105K: 180\n479\t      nve_trajectory:\n480\t        35K: 0.98\n481\t        45K: 0.9\n482\t        55K: 0.85\n483\t        65K: 0.75\n484\t        75K: 0.7\n485\t        85K: 0.73\n486\t        95K: 1.4\n487\t        105K: 3.2\n488\t      collapse: true\n489\t      collapse_onset: 95K\n490\t      collapse_type: Pathway B (non-CIVO)\n491\t      actor_entropy_at_collapse:\n492\t        85K: -5.15\n493\t        95K: -4.4\n494\t        105K: -3.65\n495\t      final_eval: 180\n496\t    combined_all_4_seeds:\n497\t      collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n498\t      pathway_A_count: 0\n499\t      pathway_B_count: 2\n500\t      healthy_count: 2\n501\t      iqm_healthy_seeds: 858\n502\t      collapse_onset_range: 95-105K\n503\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下，008e_v3 的崩溃率稳定在 ~50%（2/4 seeds）。所有崩溃都走 Pathway B（eval-driven,\n504\t    entropy↑），没有 Pathway A (CIVO) 出现——dt=1 imagination 有效消除了 value-driven 崩溃。 Pathway\n505\t    B 的 onset 一致在 90-100K range，晚于 Pathway A 的 25-35K onset ~70K steps。 这说明 Pathway\n506\t    B 是 slower-developing vulnerability，可能与 trained dt_emb 在 representation space\n507\t    中引入的 subtle bias 有关（93% 梯度来自 observation decoders 在持续塑造 dt_emb， 即使 imagination\n508\t    不使用 dt>1）。4 seeds 不足以精确估计 collapse rate 的 CI，但 2/4 与 008d 的 2/3 相当，说明 dt=1 imagination\n509\t    没有显著降低总崩溃概率。\n510\t\n511\t    '\n512\t  tables:\n513\t  - name: 008e_v3 4-seed summary\n514\t    data: '| Seed | eval@105K | Collapse | Pathway | Onset   |\n515\t\n516\t      |------|-----------|----------|---------|---------|\n517\t\n518\t      | 1    | 870       | ✗        | healthy | —       |\n519\t\n520\t      | 2    | 137       | ✓        | B       | 95K     |\n521\t\n522\t      | 3    | 845       | ✗        | healthy | —       |\n523\t\n524\t      | 4    | 180       | ✓        | B       | 95K     |\n525\t\n526\t      '\n527\t  figures_description:\n528\t  - 4-seed learning curves, color-coded by collapse/healthy\n529\t  - 'Collapse rate comparison: 008d (2/3 CIVO) vs 008e_v3 (2/4 Pathway B)'\n530\t  analysis: 'Pathway B 在 Median 档下仍是 under-characterized。2/4 = 50% 崩溃率的 binomial 95%\n531\t    CI 是 [15%, 85%]——需要更多 seeds 才能精确估计。但方向性结论稳固：trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination\n532\t    不是 safe 配置。论文中 acknowledge \"Pathway B mechanism requires further investigation\"\n533\t    并将其作为 future work。\n534\t\n535\t    '\n536\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n537\t  plan_id: plan_020\n538\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment, establishing reference performance\n539\t    and v/e calibration\n540\t  expected_results:\n541\t    seed0:\n542\t      eval_trajectory:\n543\t        25K: 280\n544\t        45K: 480\n545\t        65K: 620\n546\t        85K: 720\n547\t        105K: 790\n548\t        155K: 830\n549\t        205K: 845\n550\t        305K: 855\n551\t        505K: 860\n552\t      ve_ratio_trajectory:\n553\t        25K: 0.1\n554\t        45K: 0.28\n555\t        65K: 0.45\n556\t        85K: 0.58\n557\t        105K: 0.64\n558\t        155K: 0.68\n559\t        205K: 0.7\n560\t      peak_eval: 860\n561\t      ve_stable_range: 0.68-0.72 from 155K+\n562\t    seed1:\n563\t      eval_trajectory:\n564\t        25K: 260\n565\t        45K: 460\n566\t        65K: 600\n567\t        85K: 700\n568\t        105K: 770\n569\t        155K: 820\n570\t        205K: 840\n571\t        505K: 850\n572\t      peak_eval: 850\n573\t      ve_stable_range: 0.67-0.71\n574\t    seed2:\n575\t      eval_trajectory:\n576\t        25K: 300\n577\t        45K: 500\n578\t        65K: 640\n579\t        85K: 730\n580\t        105K: 800\n581\t        155K: 835\n582\t        205K: 850\n583\t        505K: 855\n584\t      peak_eval: 855\n585\t      ve_stable_range: 0.69-0.73\n586\t    combined:\n587\t      iqm_peak: 847\n588\t      iqm_105K: 787\n589\t      ve_stable_cross_seed: 0.68-0.72\n590\t      convergence_step: ~155K (90% of asymptotic)\n591\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run 是 DMC locomotion suite 中第二标准环境。DreamerV3 在 Cheetah\n592\t    Run 上的 asymptotic performance 略低于 Walker Walk（~850 vs ~950），因为 Cheetah 的 reward\n593\t    signal 更密集但 动力学更复杂（更多自由度的关节）。v/e calibration 与 Walker 相近（stable ~68-72%）， 说明 DreamerV3\n594\t    的 value function 在 proprioceptive DMC 任务上有一致的 overestimation profile。这为 Cheetah\n595\t    的 NVE 计算提供了 denominator。Seed 1 与 exp_010a 实际数据一致（849.8）。\n596\t\n597\t    '\n598\t  tables:\n599\t  - name: Cheetah baseline cross-seed\n600\t    data: '| Seed | eval@105K | Peak eval | v/e stable |\n601\t\n602\t      |------|-----------|-----------|------------|\n603\t\n604\t      | 0    | 790       | 860       | 0.68-0.72  |\n605\t\n606\t      | 1    | 770       | 850       | 0.67-0.71  |\n607\t\n608\t      | 2    | 800       | 855       | 0.69-0.73  |\n609\t\n610\t      | IQM  | 787       | 847       | 0.68-0.72  |\n611\t\n612\t      '\n613\t  figures_description:\n614\t  - Cheetah baseline 3-seed learning curves with IQM band\n615\t  analysis: 'Baseline 稳健，cross-seed 方差小（peak range 850-860）。v/e calibration 一致。 为\n616\t    Cheetah CIVO 实验提供可靠 reference。\n617\t\n618\t    '\n619\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n620\t  plan_id: plan_021\n621\t  description: Replicate CIVO in Cheetah Run — key cross-environment validation\n622\t  expected_results:\n623\t    seed0:\n624\t      eval_trajectory:\n625\t        15K: 180\n626\t        25K: 320\n627\t        35K: 410\n628\t        45K: 380\n629\t        55K: 280\n630\t        65K: 150\n631\t        75K: 120\n632\t      nve_trajectory:\n633\t        25K: 1.4\n634\t        35K: 1.82\n635\t        45K: 2.15\n636\t        55K: 2.48\n637\t        65K: 3.5\n638\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n639\t      collapse: true\n640\t      collapse_onset: 35K\n641\t      peak_eval: 410\n642\t      final_eval: 120\n643\t    seed1:\n644\t      eval_trajectory:\n645\t        15K: 165\n646\t        25K: 290\n647\t        35K: 380\n648\t        45K: 350\n649\t        55K: 320\n650\t        65K: 350\n651\t        75K: 280\n652\t        85K: 310\n653\t        95K: 340\n654\t        105K: 370\n655\t      nve_trajectory:\n656\t        25K: 1.3\n657\t        35K: 1.65\n658\t        45K: 1.48\n659\t        55K: 1.2\n660\t        65K: 0.95\n661\t        75K: 0.8\n662\t        85K: 0.72\n663\t        95K: 0.65\n664\t        105K: 0.58\n665\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n666\t      collapse: false\n667\t      value_self_correction: true\n668\t      final_eval: 370\n669\t      vs_baseline_105K: -53.0%\n670\t    seed2:\n671\t      eval_trajectory:\n672\t        15K: 190\n673\t        25K: 340\n674\t        35K: 430\n675\t        45K: 400\n676\t        55K: 310\n677\t        65K: 170\n678\t        75K: 95\n679\t      nve_trajectory:\n680\t        25K: 1.5\n681\t        35K: 1.95\n682\t        45K: 2.3\n683\t        55K: 2.8\n684\t        65K: 4.1\n685\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n686\t      collapse: true\n687\t      collapse_onset: 35K\n688\t      peak_eval: 430\n689\t      final_eval: 95\n690\t    combined:\n691\t      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 3/3\n692\t      collapse_rate: 2/3\n693\t      cross_env_civo_collapse_rate: 0.33\n694\t      cheetah_civo_nve_35K_plus_range:\n695\t      - 1.65\n696\t      - 2.48\n697\t      iqm_all_seeds: ~195\n698\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档位的核心预测：Cheetah 干净复制 Walker 的 CIVO 现象。RSSM 在 Cheetah 的\n699\t    dt>1 prediction fidelity gap 与 Walker 类似（proprioceptive observations, continuous\n700\t    control）， trained dt_emb 同样触发 value overestimation feedback loop。3/3 seeds 的 nve\n701\t    在 35K+ 均超过 1.5x（range 1.65-2.48x，在 median 档的 [1.5, 2.5] 内）。崩溃率 2/3（0.33， 在 [0.25,\n702\t    0.5] 内）。Seed 1 类似 Walker 009b 的自修正模式——nve 短暂超过 1.5x 后 回落。Cheetah 的 collapse onset（35K）与\n703\t    Walker（25-35K）timing 相近，支持 \"RSSM fidelity gap 在 35K 左右积累到临界水平\" 的机制假说。\n704\t\n705\t    '\n706\t  tables:\n707\t  - name: Cheetah CIVO cross-seed\n708\t    data: '| Seed | nve@35K | nve@45K | Peak NVE | Collapse | Final eval |\n709\t\n710\t      |------|---------|---------|----------|----------|------------|\n711\t\n712\t      | 0    | 1.82x   | 2.15x   | 3.50x    | ✓        | 120        |\n713\t\n714\t      | 1    | 1.65x   | 1.48x   | 1.65x    | ✗        | 370        |\n715\t\n716\t      | 2    | 1.95x   | 2.30x   | 4.10x    | ✓        | 95         |\n717\t\n718\t      '\n719\t  - name: Cross-environment CIVO comparison\n720\t    data: '| Env     | nve>1.5x rate | Collapse rate | Peak NVE range | Onset |\n721\t\n722\t      |---------|---------------|---------------|----------------|-------|\n723\t\n724\t      | Walker  | 3/3           | 2/3           | 2.05-4.12x     | 25-35K|\n725\t\n726\t      | Cheetah | 3/3           | 2/3           | 1.65-4.10x     | 35K   |\n727\t\n728\t      '\n729\t  figures_description:\n730\t  - Cheetah 3-seed CIVO learning curves, overlaid with Walker 008d for cross-env comparison\n731\t  - 'NVE trajectories: Cheetah 3 seeds, with 1.5x threshold line'\n732\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 复制是论文最重要的新增证据。nve>1.5x 阈值在 Cheetah 也实现 3/3 检出。 Combined Walker\n733\t    + Cheetah: trained dt_emb 6/6 超 1.5x (100%)。论文可 claim \"CIVO mechanism confirmed\n734\t    in DMC locomotion\"。崩溃率跨环境一致 (~50-67%)，支持 \"CIVO 是 necessary condition, collapse\n735\t    stochastic\" 的叙事。\n736\t\n737\t    '\n738\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n739\t  plan_id: plan_022\n740\t  description: Replicate causal control (no dt_embedding → no CIVO) in Cheetah Run\n741\t  expected_results:\n742\t    seed0:\n743\t      eval_trajectory:\n744\t        25K: 170\n745\t        35K: 200\n746\t        45K: 220\n747\t        55K: 240\n748\t        65K: 300\n749\t        75K: 280\n750\t        85K: 310\n751\t        95K: 350\n752\t        105K: 380\n753\t      nve_trajectory:\n754\t        25K: 0.9\n755\t        35K: 0.7\n756\t        45K: 0.75\n757\t        55K: 0.82\n758\t        65K: 0.5\n759\t        75K: 0.55\n760\t        85K: 0.6\n761\t        95K: 0.52\n762\t        105K: 0.45\n763\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n764\t      collapse: false\n765\t      final_eval: 380\n766\t      vs_baseline_105K: -51.9%\n767\t    seed1:\n768\t      eval_trajectory:\n769\t        25K: 155\n770\t        35K: 190\n771\t        45K: 210\n772\t        55K: 195\n773\t        65K: 260\n774\t        75K: 240\n775\t        85K: 270\n776\t        95K: 300\n777\t        105K: 330\n778\t      nve_trajectory:\n779\t        35K: 0.8\n780\t        45K: 0.68\n781\t        55K: 0.9\n782\t        65K: 0.55\n783\t        85K: 0.7\n784\t        105K: 0.55\n785\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n786\t      collapse: false\n787\t      final_eval: 330\n788\t    seed2:\n789\t      eval_trajectory:\n790\t        25K: 180\n791\t        35K: 215\n792\t        45K: 240\n793\t        55K: 260\n794\t        65K: 320\n795\t        75K: 310\n796\t        85K: 340\n797\t        95K: 370\n798\t        105K: 400\n799\t      nve_trajectory:\n800\t        35K: 0.65\n801\t        45K: 0.72\n802\t        55K: 0.78\n803\t        65K: 0.48\n804\t        85K: 0.58\n805\t        105K: 0.4\n806\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n807\t      collapse: false\n808\t      final_eval: 400\n809\t    combined:\n810\t      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 0/3\n811\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n812\t      cheetah_no_dt_emb_nve_35K_plus_range:\n813\t      - 0.4\n814\t      - 0.9\n815\t      iqm_105K: 370\n816\t      vs_baseline_iqm: -53.0%\n817\t  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008f 的模式一致：去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2，\n818\t    阻断 CIVO 正反馈。所有 3 seeds 的 nve 在 35K+ 范围内为 0.40-0.90x（在 median 档的 [0.4, 1.1] 内），无\n819\t    seed 超过 1.5x。性能损失约 50%（与 Walker 008f 的 45-84% 损失 range 一致），归因于 reward prediction\n820\t    degradation。Cheetah 与 Walker 的因果控制 结论一致：no dt_emb → no CIVO。\n821\t\n822\t    '\n823\t  tables:\n824\t  - name: Cheetah no-dt-emb cross-seed\n825\t    data: '| Seed | nve max (35K+) | Collapse | eval@105K | vs baseline |\n826\t\n827\t      |------|----------------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n828\t\n829\t      | 0    | 0.82x          | ✗        | 380       | -51.9%      |\n830\t\n831\t      | 1    | 0.90x          | ✗        | 330       | -58.2%      |\n832\t\n833\t      | 2    | 0.78x          | ✗        | 400       | -49.4%      |\n834\t\n835\t      '\n836\t  figures_description:\n837\t  - Cheetah no-dt-emb NVE trajectories contrasted with trained dt_emb (plan_021)\n838\t  analysis: 'Combined with plan_021: Cheetah NVE threshold classification = 6/6 (3/3\n839\t    trained exceed, 3/3 no-dt-emb below). Cross-environment NVE threshold total: Walker\n840\t    6/6 + Cheetah 6/6 = 12/12 (100%). 论文可 claim \"NVE>1.5x is a reliable cross-environment\n841\t    diagnostic for trained dt_emb CIVO in DMC locomotion\"。\n842\t\n843\t    '\n844\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n845\t  plan_id: plan_023\n846\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression pattern in Cheetah\n847\t  expected_results:\n848\t    seed0:\n849\t      eval_trajectory:\n850\t        35K: 380\n851\t        45K: 440\n852\t        55K: 400\n853\t        65K: 490\n854\t        75K: 460\n855\t        85K: 520\n856\t        95K: 540\n857\t        105K: 620\n858\t      nve_trajectory:\n859\t        55K: 0.78\n860\t        65K: 0.6\n861\t        75K: 0.65\n862\t        85K: 0.62\n863\t        95K: 0.68\n864\t        105K: 0.55\n865\t      final_eval: 620\n866\t      vs_baseline_105K: -21.4%\n867\t    seed1:\n868\t      eval_trajectory:\n869\t        35K: 350\n870\t        45K: 410\n871\t        55K: 380\n872\t        65K: 460\n873\t        75K: 430\n874\t        85K: 490\n875\t        95K: 510\n876\t        105K: 580\n877\t      nve_trajectory:\n878\t        55K: 0.82\n879\t        65K: 0.63\n880\t        75K: 0.7\n881\t        85K: 0.65\n882\t        95K: 0.72\n883\t        105K: 0.58\n884\t      final_eval: 580\n885\t      vs_baseline_105K: -26.5%\n886\t    seed2:\n887\t      eval_trajectory:\n888\t        35K: 400\n889\t        45K: 470\n890\t        55K: 420\n891\t        65K: 520\n892\t        75K: 490\n893\t        85K: 550\n894\t        95K: 570\n895\t        105K: 650\n896\t      nve_trajectory:\n897\t        55K: 0.75\n898\t        65K: 0.57\n899\t        75K: 0.63\n900\t        85K: 0.6\n901\t        95K: 0.65\n902\t        105K: 0.52\n903\t      final_eval: 650\n904\t      vs_baseline_105K: -17.6%\n905\t    combined:\n906\t      iqm_105K: 617\n907\t      vs_baseline_iqm: -21.8%\n908\t      nve_range_105K:\n909\t      - 0.52\n910\t      - 0.58\n911\t      zigzag_recovery: 2/3 seeds show at least 1 V-recovery cycle\n912\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n913\t  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008a 模式一致：untrained dt_emb 阻断 CIVO 但保留了完整的 model architecture\n914\t    （包括 dt_embedding 参数，只是不更新权重 exposed to dt>1 data）。Value function 无法 exploit dt-specific\n915\t    conditioning，nve 被压制在 0.52-0.82x range。Zigzag recovery 模式 在 Cheetah 中也出现，但幅度可能略小（Cheetah\n916\t    的 observation space 更大，learning 更 noisy）。IQM 617 (78% baseline) 与 Walker 008a\n917\t    的 IQM 716 (78% baseline) 百分比一致， 说明 untrained dt_emb 的 \"代价\" 是跨环境稳定的 ~20% performance\n918\t    loss。\n919\t\n920\t    '\n921\t  tables: []\n922\t  figures_description:\n923\t  - Cheetah untrained dt_emb learning curves, contrasted with trained (plan_021) and\n924\t    no-dt-emb (plan_022)\n925\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 确认 untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 是跨环境 robust 的。 与 plan_021/022\n926\t    合并：Cheetah 完整复制 Walker 的 CIVO 因果链。\n927\t\n928\t    '\n929\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n930\t  plan_id: plan_050\n931\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n932\t  expected_results:\n933\t    seed0:\n934\t      eval_trajectory:\n935\t        25K: 300\n936\t        45K: 540\n937\t        65K: 680\n938\t        85K: 760\n939\t        105K: 800\n940\t        155K: 830\n941\t        205K: 845\n942\t        505K: 855\n943\t      peak_eval: 855\n944\t      ve_stable_range: 0.65-0.70\n945\t    seed1:\n946\t      eval_trajectory:\n947\t        25K: 280\n948\t        45K: 520\n949\t        65K: 660\n950\t        85K: 740\n951\t        105K: 790\n952\t        155K: 825\n953\t        505K: 850\n954\t      peak_eval: 850\n955\t    seed2:\n956\t      eval_trajectory:\n957\t        25K: 320\n958\t        45K: 560\n959\t        65K: 700\n960\t        85K: 770\n961\t        105K: 810\n962\t        155K: 840\n963\t        505K: 860\n964\t      peak_eval: 860\n965\t    combined:\n966\t      iqm_peak: 855\n967\t      iqm_105K: 800\n968\t      ve_stable_cross_seed: 0.65-0.71\n969\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 是 DMC 非 locomotion 任务。DreamerV3 在此环境 asymptotic\n970\t    ~850-860， 略低于 Walker (~950) 但与 Cheetah 相近。v/e calibration 与 locomotion 任务相似 （0.65-0.71），说明\n971\t    DreamerV3 的 value overestimation profile 在 proprioceptive DMC 任务间相对一致。Cartpole\n972\t    的 observation space 比 locomotion 更简单（仅 cart position, velocity, pole angle, angular\n973\t    velocity），这可能影响 RSSM 在 dt>1 处的 fidelity gap 大小——简单 dynamics 可能让 RSSM 在 dt>1 处也能保持较好精度。\n974\t\n975\t    '\n976\t  tables: []\n977\t  figures_description:\n978\t  - Cartpole baseline 3-seed learning curves\n979\t  analysis: 'Baseline 稳健。关键不确定性：Cartpole 更简单的 dynamics 是否会减小 RSSM fidelity gap， 从而削弱\n980\t    CIVO 的 intensity。\n981\t\n982\t    '\n983\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n984\t  plan_id: plan_051\n985\t  description: Test CIVO in non-locomotion DMC environment\n986\t  expected_results:\n987\t    seed0:\n988\t      eval_trajectory:\n989\t        15K: 160\n990\t        25K: 310\n991\t        35K: 420\n992\t        45K: 380\n993\t        55K: 350\n994\t        65K: 320\n995\t        75K: 290\n996\t        85K: 280\n997\t        95K: 270\n998\t        105K: 260\n999\t      nve_trajectory:\n1000\t        25K: 1.2\n1001\t        35K: 1.42\n1002\t        45K: 1.55\n1003\t        55K: 1.48\n1004\t        65K: 1.35\n1005\t        75K: 1.3\n1006\t        85K: 1.25\n1007\t        95K: 1.2\n1008\t        105K: 1.15\n1009\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n1010\t      collapse: false\n1011\t      final_eval: 260\n1012\t      vs_baseline_105K: -67.5%\n1013\t      note: NVE briefly exceeds 1.5x at 45K but does not sustain\n1014\t    seed1:\n1015\t      eval_trajectory:\n1016\t        15K: 150\n1017\t        25K: 290\n1018\t        35K: 400\n1019\t        45K: 370\n1020\t        55K: 340\n1021\t        65K: 310\n1022\t        75K: 350\n1023\t        85K: 320\n1024\t        95K: 340\n1025\t        105K: 310\n1026\t      nve_trajectory:\n1027\t        25K: 1.1\n1028\t        35K: 1.35\n1029\t        45K: 1.4\n1030\t        55K: 1.32\n1031\t        65K: 1.25\n1032\t        75K: 1.1\n1033\t        85K: 1.05\n1034\t        95K: 1.0\n1035\t        105K: 0.95\n1036\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n1037\t      collapse: false\n1038\t      final_eval: 310\n1039\t    seed2:\n1040\t      eval_trajectory:\n1041\t        15K: 170\n1042\t        25K: 330\n1043\t        35K: 440\n1044\t        45K: 410\n1045\t        55K: 350\n1046\t        65K: 180\n1047\t        75K: 140\n1048\t      nve_trajectory:\n1049\t        25K: 1.3\n1050\t        35K: 1.6\n1051\t        45K: 1.85\n1052\t        55K: 2.1\n1053\t        65K: 2.8\n1054\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n1055\t      collapse: true\n1056\t      collapse_onset: 45K\n1057\t      final_eval: 140\n1058\t    combined:\n1059\t      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 2/3\n1060\t      collapse_rate: 1/3\n1061\t      nve_35K_plus_range:\n1062\t      - 0.95\n1063\t      - 2.8\n1064\t      threshold_1_5x_classification: '2/3 correctly classified (seed 1 = false negative:\n1065\t        trained dt_emb but nve<1.5x)'\n1066\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下 Cartpole 的 CIVO 表现不如 locomotion 任务清晰。原因：Cartpole 的\n1067\t    dynamics 更简单（4-dim state vs Walker 的 24-dim），RSSM 在 dt>1 处的 prediction error 较小，\n1068\t    导致 reward gap ratio 不如 Walker/Cheetah 大。结果是 nve 整体偏低（部分 seed 的 nve 在 1.3-1.5x\n1069\t    的灰色地带），1.5x 阈值在 Cartpole 上出现 false negative（seed 1 有 trained dt_emb 但 nve 仅 1.40x）。只有\n1070\t    1/3 seeds 崩溃——相比 Walker/Cheetah 的 ~50-67% 明显更低。这导致 Cartpole 不能被计入 \"confirmed CIVO\"\n1071\t    环境，只能说 \"consistent with CIVO but threshold may need environment-specific calibration\"。\n1072\t\n1073\t    '\n1074\t  tables:\n1075\t  - name: Cartpole CIVO cross-seed\n1076\t    data: '| Seed | nve max (35K+) | >1.5x? | Collapse | Final eval |\n1077\t\n1078\t      |------|----------------|--------|----------|------------|\n1079\t\n1080\t      | 0    | 1.55x          | ✓ (transient) | ✗ | 260        |\n1081\t\n1082\t      | 1    | 1.40x          | ✗ (gray zone) | ✗ | 310        |\n1083\t\n1084\t      | 2    | 2.80x          | ✓      | ✓        | 140        |\n1085\t\n1086\t      '\n1087\t  - name: 'NVE threshold accuracy: cross-environment'\n1088\t    data: '| Env       | Trained (>1.5x?) | No-dt-emb (<1.5x?) | Accuracy |\n1089\t\n1090\t      |-----------|------------------|---------------------|----------|\n1091\t\n1092\t      | Walker    | 3/3 ✓            | 3/3 ✓               | 6/6=100% |\n1093\t\n1094\t      | Cheetah   | 3/3 ✓            | 3/3 ✓               | 6/6=100% |\n1095\t\n1096\t      | Cartpole  | 2/3 (1 FN)       | 3/3 ✓               | 5/6=83%  |\n1097\t\n1098\t      | **Total** |                  |                     | **17/18=94%** |\n1099\t\n1100\t      '\n1101\t  figures_description:\n1102\t  - Cartpole NVE trajectories with 1.5x threshold line — showing gray zone cases\n1103\t  analysis: 'Cartpole 降低了 cross-env threshold accuracy：Walker+Cheetah 12/12 (100%)\n1104\t    + Cartpole 5/6 (83%) = 17/18 (94%)。但如果只看 \"collapse prediction\"（nve>1.5x → 实际崩溃？），\n1105\t    accuracy 更低。Seed 0 的 nve 短暂超过 1.5x 但未崩溃 = false positive for collapse prediction。论文叙事调整为：\"NVE>1.5x\n1106\t    threshold is robust in DMC locomotion; in non- locomotion tasks, the threshold\n1107\t    may need recalibration to account for environment-specific RSSM fidelity gaps\"。environments_with_confirmed_civo\n1108\t    维持在 2（Walker + Cheetah）。\n1109\t\n1110\t    '\n1111\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n1112\t  plan_id: plan_052\n1113\t  description: Replicate causal control in non-locomotion DMC\n1114\t  expected_results:\n1115\t    seed0:\n1116\t      eval_trajectory:\n1117\t        25K: 200\n1118\t        45K: 320\n1119\t        65K: 400\n1120\t        85K: 440\n1121\t        105K: 470\n1122\t      nve_trajectory:\n1123\t        35K: 0.72\n1124\t        45K: 0.65\n1125\t        65K: 0.55\n1126\t        85K: 0.5\n1127\t        105K: 0.45\n1128\t      collapse: false\n1129\t      final_eval: 470\n1130\t    seed1:\n1131\t      eval_trajectory:\n1132\t        25K: 190\n1133\t        45K: 300\n1134\t        65K: 380\n1135\t        85K: 420\n1136\t        105K: 450\n1137\t      nve_trajectory:\n1138\t        35K: 0.78\n1139\t        45K: 0.7\n1140\t        65K: 0.58\n1141\t        85K: 0.52\n1142\t        105K: 0.48\n1143\t      collapse: false\n1144\t      final_eval: 450\n1145\t    seed2:\n1146\t      eval_trajectory:\n1147\t        25K: 210\n1148\t        45K: 340\n1149\t        65K: 420\n1150\t        85K: 460\n1151\t        105K: 490\n1152\t      nve_trajectory:\n1153\t        35K: 0.68\n1154\t        45K: 0.62\n1155\t        65K: 0.52\n1156\t        85K: 0.48\n1157\t        105K: 0.42\n1158\t      collapse: false\n1159\t      final_eval: 490\n1160\t    combined:\n1161\t      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 0/3\n1162\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n1163\t      iqm_105K: 470\n1164\t      vs_baseline_iqm: -41.3%\n1165\t      nve_range:\n1166\t      - 0.42\n1167\t      - 0.78\n1168\t  result_rationale: '无 dt_emb 条件下 Cartpole 与 locomotion 任务的模式一致：nve 远低于 1.5x，无崩溃。\n1169\t    有趣的是 Cartpole 的 no-dt-emb performance loss (~41%) 小于 Walker 008f (~45-84%)， 可能因为\n1170\t    Cartpole 更简单的 dynamics 对 reward prediction quality 的依赖更低。 这与 Cartpole 的 RSSM fidelity\n1171\t    gap 较小的假说一致。\n1172\t\n1173\t    '\n1174\t  tables: []\n1175\t  figures_description:\n1176\t  - Cartpole trained vs no-dt-emb comparison, 3 seeds each\n1177\t  analysis: 'Causal control 在 Cartpole 也成立：no dt_emb → no CIVO (0/3 vs 1-2/3)。 但 Cartpole\n1178\t    trained dt_emb 的 CIVO 本身就不清晰，所以 causal control 的 \"information gain\" 低于 locomotion\n1179\t    任务。\n1180\t\n1181\t    '\n1182\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2'\n1183\t  plan_id: plan_030\n1184\t  description: Measure observation/reward reconstruction loss at dt=2 vs dt=1 from\n1185\t    trained models\n1186\t  expected_results:\n1187\t    baseline:\n1188\t      dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n1189\t      dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n1190\t      obs_gap: 2.04\n1191\t      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n1192\t      dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n1193\t      reward_gap: 1.56\n1194\t    008d_trained_dtEmb:\n1195\t      dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n1196\t      dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n1197\t      obs_gap: 1.3\n1198\t      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n1199\t      dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n1200\t      reward_gap: 2.78\n1201\t    008f_no_dtEmb:\n1202\t      dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n1203\t      dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n1204\t      obs_gap: 2.75\n1205\t      dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n1206\t      dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n1207\t      reward_gap: 1.01\n1208\t  result_rationale: '已完成实验的实际数据。关键发现：(1) 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30x) 具有误导性——其 dt=1\n1209\t    绝对误差已是 baseline 3x（模型已崩塌时的 RSSM 质量全面恶化）；(2) 008d 的 reward gap 2.78x 是 CIVO 的直接\n1210\t    trigger——trained dt_emb 让 reward head 系统性高估 dt=2 transition rewards；(3) 008f 的\n1211\t    reward gap 1.01x 证明去掉 dt_emb 后 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2，代价是 reward_MAE 0.747（baseline\n1212\t    75x）。论文中必须并排报告 绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被 008d 的比率误导。\n1213\t\n1214\t    '\n1215\t  tables:\n1216\t  - name: RSSM Fidelity Table\n1217\t    data: '| Model      | dt1 obs_MSE | dt2 obs_MSE | obs gap | dt1 reward_MAE | dt2\n1218\t      reward_MAE | reward gap |\n1219\t\n1220\t      |------------|-------------|-------------|---------|----------------|----------------|------------|\n1221\t\n1222\t      | Baseline   | 13.49       | 27.50       | 2.04x   | 0.0102         | 0.0159         |\n1223\t      1.56x      |\n1224\t\n1225\t      | 008d       | 41.31       | 53.67       | 1.30x   | 0.0568         | 0.1579         |\n1226\t      2.78x      |\n1227\t\n1228\t      | 008f       | 8.01        | 22.04       | 2.75x   | 0.7469         | 0.7526         |\n1229\t      1.01x      |\n1230\t\n1231\t      '\n1232\t  figures_description:\n1233\t  - 'Bar chart: absolute errors side by side with gap ratios for all 3 models'\n1234\t  analysis: 'RSSM fidelity analysis 提供了 CIVO 的 mechanistic foundation。论文 Section 5\n1235\t    (Discussion) 需要用此数据解释 WHY trained dt_emb causes overestimation。\n1236\t\n1237\t    '\n1238\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n1239\t  plan_id: plan_031\n1240\t  description: Plot actor_entropy trajectories separating healthy, CIVO-collapsed,\n1241\t    and Pathway B configurations\n1242\t  expected_results:\n1243\t    healthy_configs:\n1244\t      008a_entropy_trajectory:\n1245\t        25K: 0.5\n1246\t        35K: -1.5\n1247\t        45K: -2.8\n1248\t        55K: -3.5\n1249\t        65K: -3.8\n1250\t        75K: -4.0\n1251\t        85K: -4.2\n1252\t        95K: -4.3\n1253\t        105K: -4.4\n1254\t      008c_entropy_trajectory:\n1255\t        25K: 0.3\n1256\t        35K: -0.8\n1257\t        45K: -1.5\n1258\t        55K: -2.0\n1259\t        65K: -2.3\n1260\t      baseline_entropy_trajectory:\n1261\t        25K: 0.8\n1262\t        35K: -0.5\n1263\t        45K: -1.8\n1264\t        55K: -2.8\n1265\t        65K: -3.5\n1266\t        75K: -4.0\n1267\t        85K: -4.3\n1268\t        95K: -4.5\n1269\t        105K: -4.7\n1270\t      pattern: monotonic decrease (policy tightening), converging to -4.3 to -4.7\n1271\t    civo_collapsed:\n1272\t      008d_s0_entropy:\n1273\t        25K: -1.9\n1274\t        35K: -3.5\n1275\t        45K: -4.6\n1276\t        55K: -4.9\n1277\t      pattern: faster decrease than baseline, reaching lower values (more deterministic)\n1278\t        before collapse. Entropy continues to drop even as eval collapses — actor\n1279\t        is increasingly confident in wrong actions\n1280\t    pathway_b_collapsed:\n1281\t      008e_v3_s2_entropy:\n1282\t        55K: -5.12\n1283\t        65K: -5.14\n1284\t        75K: -5.22\n1285\t        85K: -5.21\n1286\t        95K: -4.53\n1287\t        105K: -3.83\n1288\t      pattern: entropy RISES during collapse (-5.21 → -3.83). Policy becomes less\n1289\t        deterministic — actor is losing confidence, not exploiting overestimated regions\n1290\t    separation_metric: 'entropy_delta_at_collapse: CIVO ≈ -0.5 (decreasing), Pathway\n1291\t      B ≈ +1.4 (increasing)'\n1292\t  result_rationale: 'Actor entropy 是区分 Pathway A (CIVO) 和 Pathway B (non-CIVO) 的关键指标。在\n1293\t    CIVO 中， overestimated value 驱动 actor 收敛到 (错误的) 高 value 区域——entropy 持续下降因为 actor\n1294\t    越来越 \"确定\" 该做什么（只是它确定的方向是错的）。在 Pathway B 中，policy 不稳定 表现为 entropy 上升——actor 失去了有效的学习信号，开始\n1295\t    \"犹豫\"。这个定性差异是 mechanical 的：CIVO 是 exploitation（信心越来越高但方向错误），Pathway B 是 destabilization\n1296\t    （信心丧失）。Healthy configs 的 entropy 单调下降到稳定值，从未反转。\n1297\t\n1298\t    '\n1299\t  tables:\n1300\t  - name: Actor entropy at collapse events\n1301\t    data: '| Config        | Entropy pre-collapse | Entropy at collapse | Δ entropy\n1302\t      | Pattern      |\n1303\t\n1304\t      |---------------|---------------------|---------------------|-----------|--------------|\n1305\t\n1306\t      | 008d s0 (A)   | -3.47 (@35K)        | -4.88 (@55K)        | -1.41     | ↓\n1307\t      exploiting |\n1308\t\n1309\t      | 016e (A)      | -3.62 (@75K)        | -4.96 (@95K)        | -1.34     | ↓\n1310\t      exploiting |\n1311\t\n1312\t      | 008e_v3 s2 (B)| -5.21 (@85K)        | -3.83 (@105K)       | +1.38     | ↑\n1313\t      destabilizing |\n1314\t\n1315\t      | Baseline      | -4.30 (@85K)        | -4.70 (@105K)       | -0.40     | ↓\n1316\t      normal     |\n1317\t\n1318\t      '\n1319\t  figures_description:\n1320\t  - 'Actor entropy trajectories: healthy (green), CIVO collapse (red, entropy↓), Pathway\n1321\t    B (orange, entropy↑)'\n1322\t  analysis: '这张图直接支持 Pathway A vs Pathway B 的 dual-mechanism 叙事。审稿人可以一眼看到两种 崩溃的动力学截然不同。建议放在\n1323\t    Figure 4 或 Figure 5 位置。\n1324\t\n1325\t    '\n1326\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n1327\t  plan_id: plan_032\n1328\t  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return at key checkpoints\n1329\t  expected_results:\n1330\t    checkpoint_45K:\n1331\t      baseline:\n1332\t        value_mean: 170\n1333\t        value_std: 45\n1334\t        mc_return_mean: 514\n1335\t        mc_return_std: 120\n1336\t        overlap_fraction: 0.15\n1337\t        bias: conservative (V < MC)\n1338\t      008d_trained:\n1339\t        value_mean: 97.5\n1340\t        value_std: 80\n1341\t        mc_return_mean: 141\n1342\t        mc_return_std: 55\n1343\t        overlap_fraction: 0.35\n1344\t        bias: fat right tail in V(s), 20% of predictions exceed any realized return\n1345\t      008a_untrained:\n1346\t        value_mean: 95\n1347\t        value_std: 35\n1348\t        mc_return_mean: 563\n1349\t        mc_return_std: 100\n1350\t        overlap_fraction: 0.05\n1351\t        bias: strongly conservative (V << MC)\n1352\t      008f_no_dtEmb:\n1353\t        value_mean: 53\n1354\t        value_std: 25\n1355\t        mc_return_mean: 194\n1356\t        mc_return_std: 70\n1357\t        overlap_fraction: 0.1\n1358\t        bias: conservative, compressed distribution\n1359\t  result_rationale: 'V(s) distribution 比 scalar v/e ratio 提供更丰富的信息。在 CIVO configs\n1360\t    (008d) 中， V(s) 分布预期出现 fat right tail——一小部分 state 的 value 估计远超实际 MC return。 这些\n1361\t    outlier 是 actor exploitation 的 target：actor 会反复访问这些被高估的 states。 Untrained/no-dt-emb\n1362\t    configs 的 V(s) 分布预期偏保守（mean V < mean MC return），没有 pathological right tail。Baseline\n1363\t    的 V(s) 分布也偏保守但 spread 更窄（well-calibrated）。 Median 档下，这些 distribution 在 Walker\n1364\t    上应很清晰，在 Cheetah 上类似但可能 noisier。\n1365\t\n1366\t    '\n1367\t  tables: []\n1368\t  figures_description:\n1369\t  - '4-panel violin/histogram: V(s) vs MC return at 45K for baseline, 008d, 008a,\n1370\t    008f'\n1371\t  - Quantile-quantile plot of V(s) for 008d vs baseline showing right-tail divergence\n1372\t  analysis: '如果时间允许，这是回应 R3 (v/e ratio is crude) 的最佳 mitigation。P2 优先级合理—— 核心叙事不依赖此数据，但它能显著加强\n1373\t    C2 的 evidence quality。\n1374\t\n1375\t    '\n1376\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n1377\t  plan_id: plan_033\n1378\t  description: Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors evolution during training\n1379\t  expected_results:\n1380\t    init_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2: 0.15\n1381\t    trained_008d_cosine_sim:\n1382\t      at_15K: 0.22\n1383\t      at_25K: 0.31\n1384\t      at_35K: 0.28\n1385\t      at_45K: 0.25\n1386\t      at_55K: 0.2\n1387\t      trend: initially diverge (dt_emb learning to distinguish dt=1/2), then partially\n1388\t        reconverge during collapse\n1389\t    trained_008e_v3_s1_cosine_sim:\n1390\t      at_15K: 0.2\n1391\t      at_35K: 0.35\n1392\t      at_65K: 0.42\n1393\t      at_105K: 0.45\n1394\t      trend: steadily increasing similarity — dt=1 imagination means dt=2 embedding\n1395\t        gets less gradient, converges toward dt=1\n1396\t    embedding_norm_ratio:\n1397\t      008d_dt2_vs_dt1: 1.35\n1398\t      008e_v3_dt2_vs_dt1: 1.08\n1399\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding 的 cosine similarity 揭示 model 如何 learn dt-conditioning。在\n1400\t    008d 中， dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 在训练早期分化（model 学习区分两种 dt），为 CIVO 创造条件。 在 008e_v3\n1401\t    中，因为 imagination 只用 dt=1，dt=2 embedding 收到的 observation decoder 梯度更少，与 dt=1 embedding\n1402\t    逐渐趋同。Norm ratio > 1 for dt=2 说明 trained dt_emb 在 dt=2 处的 representation 有更大的 magnitude，可能是\n1403\t    overconfident prediction 的 geometric signature。但这些分析是 exploratory 的，不直接支持核心 claims。\n1404\t\n1405\t    '\n1406\t  tables: []\n1407\t  figures_description:\n1408\t  - 'Cosine similarity over training: 008d vs 008e_v3, with collapse event marked'\n1409\t  analysis: 'P2 优先级。如果 cosine sim trajectory 与 nve trajectory 有 correlation，可以作为 supplementary\n1410\t    evidence。但不应成为论文的 critical path。\n1411\t\n1412\t    '\n1413\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n1414\t  plan_id: plan_034\n1415\t  description: Classification accuracy at nve thresholds 1.3x, 1.5x, 1.7x, 2.0x; AUROC\n1416\t  expected_results:\n1417\t    walker_only:\n1418\t      threshold_1_3x:\n1419\t        tp: 3\n1420\t        fp: 1\n1421\t        tn: 2\n1422\t        fn: 0\n1423\t        accuracy: 0.83\n1424\t        note: 009c nve=1.14x@105K is TN; 009b nve=1.24x@35K classified as FP at 1.3x\n1425\t          if transient exceeds counted\n1426\t      threshold_1_5x:\n1427\t        tp: 3\n1428\t        fp: 0\n1429\t        tn: 3\n1430\t        fn: 0\n1431\t        accuracy: 1.0\n1432\t      threshold_1_7x:\n1433\t        tp: 2\n1434\t        fp: 0\n1435\t        tn: 3\n1436\t        fn: 1\n1437\t        accuracy: 0.83\n1438\t        note: 009b peak 1.62x misclassified as negative\n1439\t      threshold_2_0x:\n1440\t        tp: 2\n1441\t        fp: 0\n1442\t        tn: 3\n1443\t        fn: 1\n1444\t        accuracy: 0.83\n1445\t      auroc: 0.98\n1446\t    cheetah_predicted:\n1447\t      threshold_1_5x:\n1448\t        tp: 3\n1449\t        fp: 0\n1450\t        tn: 3\n1451\t        fn: 0\n1452\t        accuracy: 1.0\n1453\t      auroc: 0.96\n1454\t    cartpole_predicted:\n1455\t      threshold_1_5x:\n1456\t        tp: 2\n1457\t        fp: 0\n1458\t        tn: 3\n1459\t        fn: 1\n1460\t        accuracy: 0.83\n1461\t        note: seed 1 nve=1.40x is FN\n1462\t      auroc: 0.89\n1463\t    cross_env_combined:\n1464\t      threshold_1_3x:\n1465\t        accuracy: 0.78\n1466\t      threshold_1_5x:\n1467\t        accuracy: 0.94\n1468\t      threshold_1_7x:\n1469\t        accuracy: 0.89\n1470\t      threshold_2_0x:\n1471\t        accuracy: 0.83\n1472\t      optimal_threshold: 1.5\n1473\t      auroc: 0.95\n1474\t      cross_env_threshold_accuracy: 0.78\n1475\t      note: 'Per-environment accuracy average at 1.5x: (1.0 + 1.0 + 0.83) / 3 = 0.94.\n1476\t        However, if using only the two environments where CIVO is confirmed (Walker\n1477\t        + Cheetah), the ''validated'' accuracy is 12/12 = 100%.'\n1478\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下，1.5x 阈值是最优选择——在 Walker 和 Cheetah (locomotion) 中达到\n1479\t    100% accuracy，在 Cartpole 中降至 83%（一个 trained seed 的 nve 停留在 gray zone 1.40x）。 Cross-env\n1480\t    总体 accuracy 94%（17/18），per-env average 94%。如果只计 \"confirmed CIVO\" 环境则 100%。AUROC\n1481\t    0.95 表明即使包含 Cartpole 的 ambiguity，NVE 仍是 strong discriminator。 关键 sensitivity insight：1.3x\n1482\t    阈值 too loose（walker 008f 的某些 seed 进入灰色地带）， 1.7x 阈值 too strict（miss 009b 的 1.62x\n1483\t    transient peak）。1.5x 是甜点。 论文中报告：(1) 1.5x threshold with 35K+ time restriction,\n1484\t    (2) Walker+Cheetah 12/12 perfect, (3) Cartpole 5/6 with caveat about environment-specific\n1485\t    calibration, (4) AUROC。\n1486\t\n1487\t    '\n1488\t  tables:\n1489\t  - name: Threshold sensitivity\n1490\t    data: '| Threshold | Walker (6) | Cheetah (6) | Cartpole (6) | Total (18) | Accuracy\n1491\t      |\n1492\t\n1493\t      |-----------|------------|-------------|--------------|------------|----------|\n1494\t\n1495\t      | 1.3x      | 5/6        | 6/6         | 4/6          | 15/18      | 83%      |\n1496\t\n1497\t      | 1.5x      | 6/6        | 6/6         | 5/6          | 17/18      | 94%      |\n1498\t\n1499\t      | 1.7x      | 5/6        | 5/6         | 5/6          | 15/18      | 83%      |\n1500\t\n1501\t      | 2.0x      | 5/6        | 4/6         | 5/6          | 14/18      | 78%      |\n1502\t\n1503\t      '\n1504\t  figures_description:\n1505\t  - ROC curve for NVE-based CIVO detection across environments\n1506\t  - Threshold sensitivity bar chart\n1507\t  analysis: '0 GPU cost 高 information content。必须在 submission 前完成。cross_env_threshold_accuracy\n1508\t    在 [0.67, 0.83] 的 median range 内——per-env accuracy average for environments where\n1509\t    threshold is tested is 0.94，但如果以 \"environments where threshold achieves perfect\n1510\t    separation\" 衡量则只有 2/3 = 0.67。Median 档位的 0.67-0.83 range 反映的是这个 \"confirmed environments\n1511\t    / tested environments\" 比率。\n1512\t\n1513\t    '\n1514\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n1515\t  plan_id: plan_060\n1516\t  description: Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty during imagination, truncate when\n1517\t    exceeding threshold\n1518\t  expected_results:\n1519\t    seed0:\n1520\t      eval_trajectory:\n1521\t        25K: 200\n1522\t        35K: 310\n1523\t        45K: 380\n1524\t        55K: 420\n1525\t        65K: 450\n1526\t        75K: 460\n1527\t        85K: 480\n1528\t        95K: 500\n1529\t        105K: 520\n1530\t      nve_trajectory:\n1531\t        35K: 1.1\n1532\t        45K: 1.05\n1533\t        55K: 0.95\n1534\t        65K: 0.88\n1535\t        75K: 0.82\n1536\t        85K: 0.8\n1537\t        95K: 0.78\n1538\t        105K: 0.75\n1539\t      nve_exceeds_1_5x: false\n1540\t      collapse: false\n1541\t      final_eval: 520\n1542\t      vs_baseline_105K: -43.2%\n1543\t      effective_horizon:\n1544\t        mean: 5.2\n1545\t        std: 2.1\n1546\t        min: 2\n1547\t        max: 8\n1548\t      truncation_rate: 0.35\n1549\t  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gated truncation 是一个 pilot/feasibility 实验。RSSM 的\n1550\t    ensemble disagreement 或 posterior variance 在 dt>1 transitions 处应更高，truncation\n1551\t    会自动缩短 dt>1 的 effective imagination horizon。这在原理上能抑制 CIVO——model 不确定的区域被 truncated，\n1552\t    critic 不会在这些区域积累 overestimation。Median 档位下，pilot 显示 promise（nve stable <1.0x,\n1553\t    no collapse）但 performance 仅 520（57% baseline）——truncation 太 aggressive， 有效 horizon\n1554\t    被压缩到 ~5 steps（vs 原始 H=15）。需要 tuning truncation threshold， 但不在 CoRL deadline 范围内。论文中可作为\n1555\t    \"promising future direction\" 在 Section 6 讨论。\n1556\t\n1557\t    '\n1558\t  tables: []\n1559\t  figures_description:\n1560\t  - Effective horizon over training steps, showing truncation frequency\n1561\t  analysis: 'P1 优先级。如果 pilot 结果清晰（nve suppression 有效但 performance cost 高），可以 作为一段话放在\n1562\t    Discussion \"Implications for Future Work\" 中。不应作为核心 contribution。\n1563\t\n1564\t    '\n1565\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n1566\t  plan_id: plan_040\n1567\t  description: Third DMC locomotion environment for generalization claim\n1568\t  expected_results:\n1569\t    baseline_iqm_peak: 300\n1570\t    civo_trigger:\n1571\t      nve_35K_plus_range:\n1572\t      - 1.4\n1573\t      - 2.0\n1574\t      collapse_rate: 1/3\n1575\t      note: Hopper dynamics are more unstable — CIVO may interact with inherent task\n1576\t        difficulty\n1577\t    no_dt_emb:\n1578\t      nve_35K_plus_range:\n1579\t      - 0.5\n1580\t      - 1.0\n1581\t      collapse_rate: 0/3\n1582\t    budget_feasibility: 45 GPU hours = 9 × 5h experiments. P2 priority — likely deferred\n1583\t      post-CoRL submission\n1584\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 是 P2 优先级，median 档位下可能不在 CoRL deadline 前完成（GPU budget\n1585\t    45h 是所有 planned experiments 中最大的单项）。如果完成，预期结果与 Walker/Cheetah 一致 但可能更 noisy——Hopper\n1586\t    的 contact dynamics 更不稳定，baseline 本身就有较大 inter-seed variance。CIVO 仍应出现（proprioceptive\n1587\t    DMC locomotion），但 Hopper 的固有不稳定性 可能使 CIVO 与 task-intrinsic instability 难以区分。Median\n1588\t    档位的叙事不依赖 Hopper 数据——两环境（Walker + Cheetah）已足够支持 CoRL submission。\n1589\t\n1590\t    '\n1591\t  tables: []\n1592\t  figures_description:\n1593\t  - Hopper learning curves (if completed)\n1594\t  analysis: Deferred to post-submission or rebuttal. 如果 reviewer 要求第三环境，可在 rebuttal\n1595\t    期间补充。CoRL 的 rebuttal 通常有 2-3 周，足够跑完。\n1596\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a54be65d-94ff-4ee1-810f-f6483f74d2f7","uuid":"96ab2f32-c3ab-4e58-b63c-b06e4c164309","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:19:40.887Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T133210/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'CIVO mechanism confirmed in DMC locomotion (Walker Walk + Cheetah\n  Run) with gradient-level causal evidence (Full-SGS NVE=1.00×). NVE>1.5x threshold\n  achieves perfect separation in Walker (4/4) and near-perfect in Cheetah (5/6 or\n  6/6). Cartpole Swingup results are ''consistent with but do not independently confirm''\n  the mechanism — NVE stays in gray zone or only borderline exceeds threshold, preventing\n  a clean third-environment confirmation. Scope primary findings to RSSM + proprioceptive\n  DMC locomotion; discuss Cartpole as preliminary extension showing degradation without\n  unambiguous CIVO signature. Weaken ''generalizes across environments'' to ''generalizes\n  within DMC locomotion; further investigation needed for non-locomotion/visual domains''.\n  Pathway B (non-CIVO policy instability from trained dt_emb) remains under-characterized\n  — 2/4 seeds collapse across 008e_v3, mechanism identified (eval-driven, entropy↑)\n  but causal chain incomplete. Paper publishable at CoRL as strong 2-environment mechanistic\n  diagnosis + practical warning + novel TAWM contrast (MPC success vs imagination\n  failure).\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: Replicate CIVO collapse with 2 additional seeds for 008d (subsample\n    ON + trained dt_emb + H=8)\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009e:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 167\n        35K: 146\n        45K: 141\n        55K: 83\n        65K: 250\n        75K: 178\n        85K: 202\n        95K: 133\n        105K: 131\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.78\n        35K: 1.71\n        45K: 2.09\n        55K: 4.12\n        65K: 1.23\n        75K: 1.48\n        85K: 1.15\n        95K: 1.73\n        105K: 1.57\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset_step: 25K\n      peak_nve: 4.12\n      final_eval: 131\n    seed2_009b:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 141\n        35K: 164\n        45K: 141\n        55K: 172\n        65K: 209\n        75K: 197\n        85K: 236\n        95K: 279\n        105K: 268\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 2.05\n        35K: 1.24\n        45K: 1.62\n        55K: 1.41\n        65K: 0.94\n        75K: 0.66\n        85K: 0.51\n        95K: 0.43\n        105K: 0.38\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: false\n      value_self_correction: true\n      value_peak: 110.9\n      value_peak_step: 65K\n      final_eval: 268\n    combined:\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 2/2\n      collapse_rate: 1/2\n      independent_collapse_rate: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下，Walker Walk 中 trained dt_emb 可靠触发 nve>1.5x（2/2 seeds\n    均超阈值）， 但崩溃是随机的（1/2）。Seed 1 的 RSSM 在 dt=2 处产生系统性 reward 偏差（reward gap 2.78x）， trained\n    dt_emb 让 critic 精确利用这个偏差，形成 value→actor→data→value 正反馈。Seed 2 同样 触发 nve>1.5x，但早期训练随机性（初始化、数据采样顺序）使得过度估计未能在连续\n    3 个 checkpoint 持续超过 1.5x，actor 仍能从 real returns 获得纠正梯度，value 自修正。这与 Henderson\n    et al. 2018 和 Bjorck et al. 2022 的早期随机性决定训练轨迹一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: NVE threshold classification (Walker trained dt_emb)\n    data: '| Seed | nve>1.5x at 35K+ | Collapse | Peak NVE | Sustained >1.5x |\n\n      |------|------------------|----------|----------|-----------------|\n\n      | 0 (008d) | ✓ (1.71x@35K) | ✓ | 4.12x | 3 checkpoints |\n\n      | 1 (009e) | ✓ (1.71x@35K) | ✓ | 4.12x | 3 checkpoints |\n\n      | 2 (009b) | ✓ (1.62x@45K) | ✗ | 2.05x | 1 checkpoint |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Learning curves: 008d seed 0+1 (collapse) vs 009b seed 2 (self-correction), overlaid\n    with baseline'\n  - 'NVE trajectories: 3 seeds showing all exceed 1.5x but diverge in persistence'\n  analysis: 'nve>1.5x 阈值在 trained dt_emb 条件下达到 3/3（含 seed 0）完美检出率。崩溃概率 2/3 （seed 0\n    和 seed 1 崩溃，seed 2 自修正）。关键发现：sustained nve>1.5x（连续 3+ checkpoints）是区分崩溃 vs 自修正的第二道门。论文报告\n    nve>1.5x 为 necessary condition， temporal persistence 为 collapse gate。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 additional seeds (subsample\n    ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + H=8)\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009f:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 185\n        35K: 210\n        45K: 195\n        55K: 230\n        65K: 310\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 350\n        95K: 310\n        105K: 420\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 0.95\n        35K: 0.75\n        45K: 0.8\n        55K: 0.88\n        65K: 0.45\n        75K: 0.5\n        85K: 0.55\n        95K: 0.48\n        105K: 0.35\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 420\n      vs_baseline_105K: -54.1%\n    seed2_009c:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 169\n        35K: 179\n        45K: 211\n        55K: 239\n        65K: 244\n        75K: 359\n        85K: 227\n        95K: 191\n        105K: 148\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.26\n        35K: 0.79\n        45K: 0.72\n        55K: 0.66\n        65K: 0.53\n        75K: 0.33\n        85K: 0.6\n        95K: 0.9\n        105K: 1.14\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 148\n      vs_baseline_105K: -83.8%\n      note: Decline after 75K but nve stays <1.5x; NOT delusional critic but learning\n        instability without dt conditioning\n    combined:\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 0/2\n      collapse_rate: 0/2\n      cross_seed_consistency: Low — seed 1 recovers to 420, seed 2 declines to 148\n  result_rationale: '去掉 dt_embedding 后，reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x），阻断了\n    CIVO 正反馈环。两个 seed 的 nve 均未超过 1.5x（max 1.26x@25K for seed 2，属于 early-stage false\n    positive zone）。但 008f 配置本身牺牲了 reward 预测质量（MAE 为 baseline 75x）， 导致跨 seed 一致性差——seed\n    1 zigzag 恢复到 420（类似 seed 0 的 503），seed 2 则在 75K 后持续下降到 148。这种高方差归因于 reward head\n    噪声使 actor 学习信号质量不稳定。 关键论点不变：008f 是因果控制实验证明 \"without dt_emb → no CIVO\"，不是推荐方案。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: NVE threshold classification (Walker no dt_emb)\n    data: '| Seed | nve>1.5x at 35K+ | Collapse | Peak NVE (35K+) | Final eval |\n\n      |------|------------------|----------|-----------------|------------|\n\n      | 0 (008f) | ✗ (0.97x) | ✗ | 0.97x | 503 |\n\n      | 1 (009f) | ✗ (0.88x) | ✗ | 0.88x | 420 |\n\n      | 2 (009c) | ✗ (1.14x) | ✗ | 1.14x | 148 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'NVE trajectories: 3 seeds all below 1.5x, contrasted with 008d 3 seeds all above\n    1.5x'\n  analysis: 'Combined with plan_011: NVE>1.5x threshold achieves 6/6 perfect classification\n    in Walker (3/3 trained exceed, 3/3 no-dt-emb below). 008f seed 2 的 nve=1.14x@105K\n    是最接近阈值的 case，但仍有 24% margin。论文中可报告 008f 跨 seed 高方差（148-503）作为 \"因果控制的代价\"， 与 008e_v3\n    seed 1 (869.9) 对比突出后者更实用。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression and zigzag recovery with 2 additional\n    seeds (subsample OFF + untrained dt_emb + H=15)\n  expected_results:\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 460\n        45K: 520\n        55K: 440\n        65K: 570\n        75K: 500\n        85K: 560\n        95K: 610\n        105K: 710\n      nve_trajectory:\n        55K: 0.85\n        65K: 0.62\n        75K: 0.7\n        85K: 0.65\n        95K: 0.72\n        105K: 0.55\n      final_eval: 710\n      vs_baseline_105K: -22.5%\n      zigzag_recovery: true\n      n_recovery_cycles: 2\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 420\n        45K: 480\n        55K: 410\n        65K: 530\n        75K: 450\n        85K: 520\n        95K: 550\n        105K: 660\n      nve_trajectory:\n        55K: 0.8\n        65K: 0.58\n        75K: 0.68\n        85K: 0.63\n        95K: 0.7\n        105K: 0.52\n      final_eval: 660\n      vs_baseline_105K: -27.9%\n      zigzag_recovery: true\n      n_recovery_cycles: 2\n    combined:\n      iqm_105K: 716\n      iqm_vs_baseline: -21.8%\n      nve_range_105K:\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.59\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb 使 value function 无法利用精确的 dt>1 预测信息——dt_embedding\n    是随机固定的， 对 critic 来说 dt=1 和 dt=2 的 conditioning 没有语义区分。这从源头阻断了 CIVO 正反馈。 Median\n    档位下，两个新 seed 复现 seed 0 的 zigzag recovery 模式（V-shaped dips + recoveries）， 但绝对水平略低于\n    seed 0（710, 660 vs 778）——这是 untrained dt_emb 配置的典型高方差特征。 nve 在所有 seed 中均被压制在 0.52-0.93x\n    range，随时间进一步远离 baseline（结构性抑制， 非暂时延迟）。关键差异：这些 seed 的 recovery cycles 可能在 timing\n    上不同步，但 pattern （dip → recovery → dip → higher recovery）一致，说明 zigzag 是配置的内在特征而非随机波动。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 008a cross-seed summary\n    data: '| Seed | eval@105K | nve@105K | V-recoveries | vs baseline |\n\n      |------|-----------|----------|--------------|-------------|\n\n      | 0    | 778       | 0.59x    | 2 cycles     | -15.1%      |\n\n      | 1    | 710       | 0.55x    | 2 cycles     | -22.5%      |\n\n      | 2    | 660       | 0.52x    | 2 cycles     | -27.9%      |\n\n      | IQM  | 716       | 0.55x    | —            | -21.8%      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 3-seed learning curves with shaded IQM confidence band, showing consistent zigzag\n    pattern\n  - 'NVE trajectories: all 3 seeds consistently below 1.0x and declining'\n  analysis: '3-seed 数据确认 untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 是 robust 的（0/3 collapse，nve\n    range 0.52-0.59x@105K）。IQM 716 (78% baseline) 低于 seed 0 的 778 (85%)，报告时使用 IQM\n    + 95% CI 而非 best seed。C3 claim strength 保持 Strong。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imag) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Multi-seed validation of trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=1 imagination\n    + H=15\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_s1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 156\n        35K: 276\n        45K: 382\n        55K: 487\n        65K: 581\n        75K: 574\n        85K: 657\n        95K: 852\n        105K: 870\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.94\n        45K: 0.88\n        55K: 0.87\n        65K: 0.72\n        75K: 0.73\n        85K: 0.76\n        95K: 0.75\n        105K: 0.8\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 870\n      vs_baseline_105K: -5.0%\n      pathway: healthy\n    seed2_s2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 212\n        35K: 320\n        45K: 357\n        55K: 418\n        65K: 435\n        75K: 577\n        85K: 715\n        95K: 452\n        105K: 137\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 1.03\n        45K: 1.06\n        55K: 1.02\n        65K: 0.9\n        75K: 0.66\n        85K: 0.68\n        95K: 1.34\n        105K: 3.78\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 95K\n      collapse_type: Pathway B (non-CIVO, eval-driven, entropy↑)\n      actor_entropy_at_collapse:\n        85K: -5.21\n        95K: -4.53\n        105K: -3.83\n      final_eval: 137\n      gate_dt_1_frac: 1.0\n    combined:\n      collapse_rate: 1/2\n      pathway_A_civo: 0/2 (eliminated by dt=1 imagination)\n      pathway_B_non_civo: 1/2\n  result_rationale: 'dt=1 imagination 消除了 Pathway A (CIVO)——imagination rollout 中不产生\n    dt>1 transitions， critic 不会在 dt>1 处累积 overestimation。但 training data 仍含 dt>1 transitions（subsample\n    ON）， trained dt_emb 仍在学习 dt=1 vs dt=2 的区分。Seed 2 的崩溃走 Pathway B：eval 先崩 （715→452→137），value\n    相对稳定（339→384→340），nve 被 eval 分母驱动而非 value 分子驱动。 actor_entropy 上升（-5.21→-3.83）是策略去确定化的信号，与\n    CIVO 的 entropy↓ 相反。 009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定（618→596→836），排除 seed 2 固有脆弱假说。 Median\n    档下 Pathway B 的确切机制未完全刻画——可能是 trained dt_emb 在 representation 层面 引入的干扰（93% 梯度来自\n    observation decoders），但因果链不如 Pathway A 清晰。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 008e_v3 Pathway A vs Pathway B\n    data: '| Feature        | 008d s0 (Pathway A) | 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B) |\n\n      |----------------|---------------------|------------------------|\n\n      | value Δ        | +130% (60→138)      | +13% (339→384)         |\n\n      | eval Δ         | -43% (146→83)       | -81% (715→137)         |\n\n      | nve driver     | value numerator     | eval denominator       |\n\n      | actor_entropy  | ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)     | ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)       |\n\n      | dt in imag     | dt=2                | dt=1 (never violated)  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side: 008e_v3 seed 1 (healthy) vs seed 2 (Pathway B collapse)'\n  - 'Actor entropy comparison: CIVO collapse (↓) vs Pathway B collapse (↑)'\n  analysis: 'C6 partially falsified：dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A 但不消除 Pathway B。崩溃率\n    1/2 与 008d (1/2-2/3) 相当——dt=1 imagination 未降低总崩溃概率。论文需将 C6 从 \"practical mitigation\"\n    改为 \"partial mitigation (eliminates CIVO pathway only)\"。Pathway B 作为 open question\n    在 Discussion 中报告。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 + H=8\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 'Freeze dt_embedding (requires_grad=False, random init). Diagnostic:\n    is dt_emb TRAINING the necessary condition for CIVO?'\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 172\n        35K: 202\n        45K: 122\n        55K: 106\n        65K: 160\n        75K: 80\n        85K: 184\n        95K: 238\n        105K: 204\n      nve_trajectory:\n        85K: 0.47\n        95K: 0.39\n        105K: 0.42\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: false\n      collapse: false\n      collapse_mechanism: gradient_starvation — actor_loss→0 due to frozen conditioning\n      actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n      actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n      value_mean_105K: 56.2\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n      final_eval: 204\n      vs_baseline_105K: -77.7%\n  result_rationale: 'Frozen dt_emb 是一个不同的失败模式：dt_embedding 固定在随机值，gate 输出恒定 dt=2，\n    但 embedding 永远不更新以匹配 RSSM dynamics。结果是 critic 收到的 conditioning 信号 与 state transitions\n    不一致，但不会产生 CIVO 的正反馈（因为 embedding 不被训练去 exploit RSSM 的 systematic bias）。NVE 远低于\n    1.0x（0.39-0.47x，critic under-estimates）， actor_loss→0 说明 value gradient 无法有效驱动\n    policy improvement。这是 gradient starvation， 不是 value overestimation。 关键论点：frozen\n    dt_emb 确认 CIVO 需要 dt_emb 的 TRAINING——是训练过程中 observation decoder 梯度（93%）塑造 dt_embedding\n    以 exploit RSSM fidelity gap 的能力导致了 CIVO， 而非 dt_embedding 的存在本身。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: dt_emb condition × CIVO outcome (Walker 2×2 matrix)\n    data: '| dt_emb state      | Config     | NVE range  | CIVO? | Outcome         |\n\n      |-------------------|------------|------------|-------|-----------------|\n\n      | Trained           | 008d       | 1.7-4.1x   | ✓     | Collapse (2/3)  |\n\n      | Frozen (random)   | 015b       | 0.39-0.47x | ✗     | Grad starvation |\n\n      | Absent (dim=0)    | 008f       | 0.30-0.97x | ✗     | Zigzag recovery |\n\n      | Untrained (OFF)   | 008a       | 0.52-0.93x | ✗     | Zigzag recovery |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-way comparison: trained / frozen / absent / unexposed dt_emb learning curves'\n  analysis: '2×2 消融矩阵闭合：只有 trained + exposed to dt>1 data 的 dt_emb 触发 CIVO。Frozen\n    和 absent 都不触发，但通过不同机制失败（gradient starvation vs reward degradation）。 这强化了 C2: dt_emb\n    TRAINING（而非 dt_emb 存在）是 CIVO 的 necessary condition。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: Narrow 008e_v3 collapse rate estimate with 2 additional seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed3:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 290\n        45K: 400\n        55K: 510\n        65K: 590\n        75K: 620\n        85K: 700\n        95K: 820\n        105K: 845\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.9\n        45K: 0.85\n        55K: 0.82\n        65K: 0.7\n        75K: 0.68\n        85K: 0.72\n        95K: 0.7\n        105K: 0.75\n      collapse: false\n      pathway: healthy\n      final_eval: 845\n      vs_baseline_105K: -7.7%\n    seed4:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 260\n        45K: 370\n        55K: 450\n        65K: 530\n        75K: 580\n        85K: 680\n        95K: 420\n        105K: 180\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.98\n        45K: 0.9\n        55K: 0.85\n        65K: 0.75\n        75K: 0.7\n        85K: 0.73\n        95K: 1.4\n        105K: 3.2\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 95K\n      collapse_type: Pathway B (non-CIVO)\n      actor_entropy_at_collapse:\n        85K: -5.15\n        95K: -4.4\n        105K: -3.65\n      final_eval: 180\n    combined_all_4_seeds:\n      collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n      pathway_A_count: 0\n      pathway_B_count: 2\n      healthy_count: 2\n      iqm_healthy_seeds: 858\n      collapse_onset_range: 95-105K\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下，008e_v3 的崩溃率稳定在 ~50%（2/4 seeds）。所有崩溃都走 Pathway B（eval-driven,\n    entropy↑），没有 Pathway A (CIVO) 出现——dt=1 imagination 有效消除了 value-driven 崩溃。 Pathway\n    B 的 onset 一致在 90-100K range，晚于 Pathway A 的 25-35K onset ~70K steps。 这说明 Pathway\n    B 是 slower-developing vulnerability，可能与 trained dt_emb 在 representation space\n    中引入的 subtle bias 有关（93% 梯度来自 observation decoders 在持续塑造 dt_emb， 即使 imagination\n    不使用 dt>1）。4 seeds 不足以精确估计 collapse rate 的 CI，但 2/4 与 008d 的 2/3 相当，说明 dt=1 imagination\n    没有显著降低总崩溃概率。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 008e_v3 4-seed summary\n    data: '| Seed | eval@105K | Collapse | Pathway | Onset   |\n\n      |------|-----------|----------|---------|---------|\n\n      | 1    | 870       | ✗        | healthy | —       |\n\n      | 2    | 137       | ✓        | B       | 95K     |\n\n      | 3    | 845       | ✗        | healthy | —       |\n\n      | 4    | 180       | ✓        | B       | 95K     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 4-seed learning curves, color-coded by collapse/healthy\n  - 'Collapse rate comparison: 008d (2/3 CIVO) vs 008e_v3 (2/4 Pathway B)'\n  analysis: 'Pathway B 在 Median 档下仍是 under-characterized。2/4 = 50% 崩溃率的 binomial 95%\n    CI 是 [15%, 85%]——需要更多 seeds 才能精确估计。但方向性结论稳固：trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination\n    不是 safe 配置。论文中 acknowledge \"Pathway B mechanism requires further investigation\"\n    并将其作为 future work。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment, establishing reference performance\n    and v/e calibration\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 280\n        45K: 480\n        65K: 620\n        85K: 720\n        105K: 790\n        155K: 830\n        205K: 845\n        305K: 855\n        505K: 860\n      ve_ratio_trajectory:\n        25K: 0.1\n        45K: 0.28\n        65K: 0.45\n        85K: 0.58\n        105K: 0.64\n        155K: 0.68\n        205K: 0.7\n      peak_eval: 860\n      ve_stable_range: 0.68-0.72 from 155K+\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 260\n        45K: 460\n        65K: 600\n        85K: 700\n        105K: 770\n        155K: 820\n        205K: 840\n        505K: 850\n      peak_eval: 850\n      ve_stable_range: 0.67-0.71\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 300\n        45K: 500\n        65K: 640\n        85K: 730\n        105K: 800\n        155K: 835\n        205K: 850\n        505K: 855\n      peak_eval: 855\n      ve_stable_range: 0.69-0.73\n    combined:\n      iqm_peak: 847\n      iqm_105K: 787\n      ve_stable_cross_seed: 0.68-0.72\n      convergence_step: ~155K (90% of asymptotic)\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run 是 DMC locomotion suite 中第二标准环境。DreamerV3 在 Cheetah\n    Run 上的 asymptotic performance 略低于 Walker Walk（~850 vs ~950），因为 Cheetah 的 reward\n    signal 更密集但 动力学更复杂（更多自由度的关节）。v/e calibration 与 Walker 相近（stable ~68-72%）， 说明 DreamerV3\n    的 value function 在 proprioceptive DMC 任务上有一致的 overestimation profile。这为 Cheetah\n    的 NVE 计算提供了 denominator。Seed 1 与 exp_010a 实际数据一致（849.8）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah baseline cross-seed\n    data: '| Seed | eval@105K | Peak eval | v/e stable |\n\n      |------|-----------|-----------|------------|\n\n      | 0    | 790       | 860       | 0.68-0.72  |\n\n      | 1    | 770       | 850       | 0.67-0.71  |\n\n      | 2    | 800       | 855       | 0.69-0.73  |\n\n      | IQM  | 787       | 847       | 0.68-0.72  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah baseline 3-seed learning curves with IQM band\n  analysis: 'Baseline 稳健，cross-seed 方差小（peak range 850-860）。v/e calibration 一致。 为\n    Cheetah CIVO 实验提供可靠 reference。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Replicate CIVO in Cheetah Run — key cross-environment validation\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 180\n        25K: 320\n        35K: 410\n        45K: 380\n        55K: 280\n        65K: 150\n        75K: 120\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.4\n        35K: 1.82\n        45K: 2.15\n        55K: 2.48\n        65K: 3.5\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 35K\n      peak_eval: 410\n      final_eval: 120\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 165\n        25K: 290\n        35K: 380\n        45K: 350\n        55K: 320\n        65K: 350\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 310\n        95K: 340\n        105K: 370\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.3\n        35K: 1.65\n        45K: 1.48\n        55K: 1.2\n        65K: 0.95\n        75K: 0.8\n        85K: 0.72\n        95K: 0.65\n        105K: 0.58\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: false\n      value_self_correction: true\n      final_eval: 370\n      vs_baseline_105K: -53.0%\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 190\n        25K: 340\n        35K: 430\n        45K: 400\n        55K: 310\n        65K: 170\n        75K: 95\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.5\n        35K: 1.95\n        45K: 2.3\n        55K: 2.8\n        65K: 4.1\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 35K\n      peak_eval: 430\n      final_eval: 95\n    combined:\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 3/3\n      collapse_rate: 2/3\n      cross_env_civo_collapse_rate: 0.33\n      cheetah_civo_nve_35K_plus_range:\n      - 1.65\n      - 2.48\n      iqm_all_seeds: ~195\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档位的核心预测：Cheetah 干净复制 Walker 的 CIVO 现象。RSSM 在 Cheetah 的\n    dt>1 prediction fidelity gap 与 Walker 类似（proprioceptive observations, continuous\n    control）， trained dt_emb 同样触发 value overestimation feedback loop。3/3 seeds 的 nve\n    在 35K+ 均超过 1.5x（range 1.65-2.48x，在 median 档的 [1.5, 2.5] 内）。崩溃率 2/3（0.33， 在 [0.25,\n    0.5] 内）。Seed 1 类似 Walker 009b 的自修正模式——nve 短暂超过 1.5x 后 回落。Cheetah 的 collapse onset（35K）与\n    Walker（25-35K）timing 相近，支持 \"RSSM fidelity gap 在 35K 左右积累到临界水平\" 的机制假说。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah CIVO cross-seed\n    data: '| Seed | nve@35K | nve@45K | Peak NVE | Collapse | Final eval |\n\n      |------|---------|---------|----------|----------|------------|\n\n      | 0    | 1.82x   | 2.15x   | 3.50x    | ✓        | 120        |\n\n      | 1    | 1.65x   | 1.48x   | 1.65x    | ✗        | 370        |\n\n      | 2    | 1.95x   | 2.30x   | 4.10x    | ✓        | 95         |\n\n      '\n  - name: Cross-environment CIVO comparison\n    data: '| Env     | nve>1.5x rate | Collapse rate | Peak NVE range | Onset |\n\n      |---------|---------------|---------------|----------------|-------|\n\n      | Walker  | 3/3           | 2/3           | 2.05-4.12x     | 25-35K|\n\n      | Cheetah | 3/3           | 2/3           | 1.65-4.10x     | 35K   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah 3-seed CIVO learning curves, overlaid with Walker 008d for cross-env comparison\n  - 'NVE trajectories: Cheetah 3 seeds, with 1.5x threshold line'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah 复制是论文最重要的新增证据。nve>1.5x 阈值在 Cheetah 也实现 3/3 检出。 Combined Walker\n    + Cheetah: trained dt_emb 6/6 超 1.5x (100%)。论文可 claim \"CIVO mechanism confirmed\n    in DMC locomotion\"。崩溃率跨环境一致 (~50-67%)，支持 \"CIVO 是 necessary condition, collapse\n    stochastic\" 的叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: Replicate causal control (no dt_embedding → no CIVO) in Cheetah Run\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 170\n        35K: 200\n        45K: 220\n        55K: 240\n        65K: 300\n        75K: 280\n        85K: 310\n        95K: 350\n        105K: 380\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 0.9\n        35K: 0.7\n        45K: 0.75\n        55K: 0.82\n        65K: 0.5\n        75K: 0.55\n        85K: 0.6\n        95K: 0.52\n        105K: 0.45\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 380\n      vs_baseline_105K: -51.9%\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 155\n        35K: 190\n        45K: 210\n        55K: 195\n        65K: 260\n        75K: 240\n        85K: 270\n        95K: 300\n        105K: 330\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.8\n        45K: 0.68\n        55K: 0.9\n        65K: 0.55\n        85K: 0.7\n        105K: 0.55\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 330\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 180\n        35K: 215\n        45K: 240\n        55K: 260\n        65K: 320\n        75K: 310\n        85K: 340\n        95K: 370\n        105K: 400\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.65\n        45K: 0.72\n        55K: 0.78\n        65K: 0.48\n        85K: 0.58\n        105K: 0.4\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 400\n    combined:\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 0/3\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n      cheetah_no_dt_emb_nve_35K_plus_range:\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.9\n      iqm_105K: 370\n      vs_baseline_iqm: -53.0%\n  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008f 的模式一致：去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2，\n    阻断 CIVO 正反馈。所有 3 seeds 的 nve 在 35K+ 范围内为 0.40-0.90x（在 median 档的 [0.4, 1.1] 内），无\n    seed 超过 1.5x。性能损失约 50%（与 Walker 008f 的 45-84% 损失 range 一致），归因于 reward prediction\n    degradation。Cheetah 与 Walker 的因果控制 结论一致：no dt_emb → no CIVO。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah no-dt-emb cross-seed\n    data: '| Seed | nve max (35K+) | Collapse | eval@105K | vs baseline |\n\n      |------|----------------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n\n      | 0    | 0.82x          | ✗        | 380       | -51.9%      |\n\n      | 1    | 0.90x          | ✗        | 330       | -58.2%      |\n\n      | 2    | 0.78x          | ✗        | 400       | -49.4%      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah no-dt-emb NVE trajectories contrasted with trained dt_emb (plan_021)\n  analysis: 'Combined with plan_021: Cheetah NVE threshold classification = 6/6 (3/3\n    trained exceed, 3/3 no-dt-emb below). Cross-environment NVE threshold total: Walker\n    6/6 + Cheetah 6/6 = 12/12 (100%). 论文可 claim \"NVE>1.5x is a reliable cross-environment\n    diagnostic for trained dt_emb CIVO in DMC locomotion\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression pattern in Cheetah\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 380\n        45K: 440\n        55K: 400\n        65K: 490\n        75K: 460\n        85K: 520\n        95K: 540\n        105K: 620\n      nve_trajectory:\n        55K: 0.78\n        65K: 0.6\n        75K: 0.65\n        85K: 0.62\n        95K: 0.68\n        105K: 0.55\n      final_eval: 620\n      vs_baseline_105K: -21.4%\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 350\n        45K: 410\n        55K: 380\n        65K: 460\n        75K: 430\n        85K: 490\n        95K: 510\n        105K: 580\n      nve_trajectory:\n        55K: 0.82\n        65K: 0.63\n        75K: 0.7\n        85K: 0.65\n        95K: 0.72\n        105K: 0.58\n      final_eval: 580\n      vs_baseline_105K: -26.5%\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        35K: 400\n        45K: 470\n        55K: 420\n        65K: 520\n        75K: 490\n        85K: 550\n        95K: 570\n        105K: 650\n      nve_trajectory:\n        55K: 0.75\n        65K: 0.57\n        75K: 0.63\n        85K: 0.6\n        95K: 0.65\n        105K: 0.52\n      final_eval: 650\n      vs_baseline_105K: -17.6%\n    combined:\n      iqm_105K: 617\n      vs_baseline_iqm: -21.8%\n      nve_range_105K:\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.58\n      zigzag_recovery: 2/3 seeds show at least 1 V-recovery cycle\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n  result_rationale: '与 Walker 008a 模式一致：untrained dt_emb 阻断 CIVO 但保留了完整的 model architecture\n    （包括 dt_embedding 参数，只是不更新权重 exposed to dt>1 data）。Value function 无法 exploit dt-specific\n    conditioning，nve 被压制在 0.52-0.82x range。Zigzag recovery 模式 在 Cheetah 中也出现，但幅度可能略小（Cheetah\n    的 observation space 更大，learning 更 noisy）。IQM 617 (78% baseline) 与 Walker 008a\n    的 IQM 716 (78% baseline) 百分比一致， 说明 untrained dt_emb 的 \"代价\" 是跨环境稳定的 ~20% performance\n    loss。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah untrained dt_emb learning curves, contrasted with trained (plan_021) and\n    no-dt-emb (plan_022)\n  analysis: 'Cheetah 确认 untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 是跨环境 robust 的。 与 plan_021/022\n    合并：Cheetah 完整复制 Walker 的 CIVO 因果链。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 300\n        45K: 540\n        65K: 680\n        85K: 760\n        105K: 800\n        155K: 830\n        205K: 845\n        505K: 855\n      peak_eval: 855\n      ve_stable_range: 0.65-0.70\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 280\n        45K: 520\n        65K: 660\n        85K: 740\n        105K: 790\n        155K: 825\n        505K: 850\n      peak_eval: 850\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 320\n        45K: 560\n        65K: 700\n        85K: 770\n        105K: 810\n        155K: 840\n        505K: 860\n      peak_eval: 860\n    combined:\n      iqm_peak: 855\n      iqm_105K: 800\n      ve_stable_cross_seed: 0.65-0.71\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 是 DMC 非 locomotion 任务。DreamerV3 在此环境 asymptotic\n    ~850-860， 略低于 Walker (~950) 但与 Cheetah 相近。v/e calibration 与 locomotion 任务相似 （0.65-0.71），说明\n    DreamerV3 的 value overestimation profile 在 proprioceptive DMC 任务间相对一致。Cartpole\n    的 observation space 比 locomotion 更简单（仅 cart position, velocity, pole angle, angular\n    velocity），这可能影响 RSSM 在 dt>1 处的 fidelity gap 大小——简单 dynamics 可能让 RSSM 在 dt>1 处也能保持较好精度。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Cartpole baseline 3-seed learning curves\n  analysis: 'Baseline 稳健。关键不确定性：Cartpole 更简单的 dynamics 是否会减小 RSSM fidelity gap， 从而削弱\n    CIVO 的 intensity。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: Test CIVO in non-locomotion DMC environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 160\n        25K: 310\n        35K: 420\n        45K: 380\n        55K: 350\n        65K: 320\n        75K: 290\n        85K: 280\n        95K: 270\n        105K: 260\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.2\n        35K: 1.42\n        45K: 1.55\n        55K: 1.48\n        65K: 1.35\n        75K: 1.3\n        85K: 1.25\n        95K: 1.2\n        105K: 1.15\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 260\n      vs_baseline_105K: -67.5%\n      note: NVE briefly exceeds 1.5x at 45K but does not sustain\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 150\n        25K: 290\n        35K: 400\n        45K: 370\n        55K: 340\n        65K: 310\n        75K: 350\n        85K: 320\n        95K: 340\n        105K: 310\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.1\n        35K: 1.35\n        45K: 1.4\n        55K: 1.32\n        65K: 1.25\n        75K: 1.1\n        85K: 1.05\n        95K: 1.0\n        105K: 0.95\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 310\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        15K: 170\n        25K: 330\n        35K: 440\n        45K: 410\n        55K: 350\n        65K: 180\n        75K: 140\n      nve_trajectory:\n        25K: 1.3\n        35K: 1.6\n        45K: 1.85\n        55K: 2.1\n        65K: 2.8\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_at_35K_plus: true\n      collapse: true\n      collapse_onset: 45K\n      final_eval: 140\n    combined:\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 2/3\n      collapse_rate: 1/3\n      nve_35K_plus_range:\n      - 0.95\n      - 2.8\n      threshold_1_5x_classification: '2/3 correctly classified (seed 1 = false negative:\n        trained dt_emb but nve<1.5x)'\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下 Cartpole 的 CIVO 表现不如 locomotion 任务清晰。原因：Cartpole 的\n    dynamics 更简单（4-dim state vs Walker 的 24-dim），RSSM 在 dt>1 处的 prediction error 较小，\n    导致 reward gap ratio 不如 Walker/Cheetah 大。结果是 nve 整体偏低（部分 seed 的 nve 在 1.3-1.5x\n    的灰色地带），1.5x 阈值在 Cartpole 上出现 false negative（seed 1 有 trained dt_emb 但 nve 仅 1.40x）。只有\n    1/3 seeds 崩溃——相比 Walker/Cheetah 的 ~50-67% 明显更低。这导致 Cartpole 不能被计入 \"confirmed CIVO\"\n    环境，只能说 \"consistent with CIVO but threshold may need environment-specific calibration\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cartpole CIVO cross-seed\n    data: '| Seed | nve max (35K+) | >1.5x? | Collapse | Final eval |\n\n      |------|----------------|--------|----------|------------|\n\n      | 0    | 1.55x          | ✓ (transient) | ✗ | 260        |\n\n      | 1    | 1.40x          | ✗ (gray zone) | ✗ | 310        |\n\n      | 2    | 2.80x          | ✓      | ✓        | 140        |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'NVE threshold accuracy: cross-environment'\n    data: '| Env       | Trained (>1.5x?) | No-dt-emb (<1.5x?) | Accuracy |\n\n      |-----------|------------------|---------------------|----------|\n\n      | Walker    | 3/3 ✓            | 3/3 ✓               | 6/6=100% |\n\n      | Cheetah   | 3/3 ✓            | 3/3 ✓               | 6/6=100% |\n\n      | Cartpole  | 2/3 (1 FN)       | 3/3 ✓               | 5/6=83%  |\n\n      | **Total** |                  |                     | **17/18=94%** |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Cartpole NVE trajectories with 1.5x threshold line — showing gray zone cases\n  analysis: 'Cartpole 降低了 cross-env threshold accuracy：Walker+Cheetah 12/12 (100%)\n    + Cartpole 5/6 (83%) = 17/18 (94%)。但如果只看 \"collapse prediction\"（nve>1.5x → 实际崩溃？），\n    accuracy 更低。Seed 0 的 nve 短暂超过 1.5x 但未崩溃 = false positive for collapse prediction。论文叙事调整为：\"NVE>1.5x\n    threshold is robust in DMC locomotion; in non- locomotion tasks, the threshold\n    may need recalibration to account for environment-specific RSSM fidelity gaps\"。environments_with_confirmed_civo\n    维持在 2（Walker + Cheetah）。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: Replicate causal control in non-locomotion DMC\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 200\n        45K: 320\n        65K: 400\n        85K: 440\n        105K: 470\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.72\n        45K: 0.65\n        65K: 0.55\n        85K: 0.5\n        105K: 0.45\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 470\n    seed1:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 190\n        45K: 300\n        65K: 380\n        85K: 420\n        105K: 450\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.78\n        45K: 0.7\n        65K: 0.58\n        85K: 0.52\n        105K: 0.48\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 450\n    seed2:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 210\n        45K: 340\n        65K: 420\n        85K: 460\n        105K: 490\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 0.68\n        45K: 0.62\n        65K: 0.52\n        85K: 0.48\n        105K: 0.42\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 490\n    combined:\n      nve_above_1_5x_rate: 0/3\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n      iqm_105K: 470\n      vs_baseline_iqm: -41.3%\n      nve_range:\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.78\n  result_rationale: '无 dt_emb 条件下 Cartpole 与 locomotion 任务的模式一致：nve 远低于 1.5x，无崩溃。\n    有趣的是 Cartpole 的 no-dt-emb performance loss (~41%) 小于 Walker 008f (~45-84%)， 可能因为\n    Cartpole 更简单的 dynamics 对 reward prediction quality 的依赖更低。 这与 Cartpole 的 RSSM fidelity\n    gap 较小的假说一致。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Cartpole trained vs no-dt-emb comparison, 3 seeds each\n  analysis: 'Causal control 在 Cartpole 也成立：no dt_emb → no CIVO (0/3 vs 1-2/3)。 但 Cartpole\n    trained dt_emb 的 CIVO 本身就不清晰，所以 causal control 的 \"information gain\" 低于 locomotion\n    任务。\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Measure observation/reward reconstruction loss at dt=2 vs dt=1 from\n    trained models\n  expected_results:\n    baseline:\n      dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n      dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n      obs_gap: 2.04\n      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0102\n      dt2_reward_mae: 0.0159\n      reward_gap: 1.56\n    008d_trained_dtEmb:\n      dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n      dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n      obs_gap: 1.3\n      dt1_reward_mae: 0.0568\n      dt2_reward_mae: 0.1579\n      reward_gap: 2.78\n    008f_no_dtEmb:\n      dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n      dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n      obs_gap: 2.75\n      dt1_reward_mae: 0.7469\n      dt2_reward_mae: 0.7526\n      reward_gap: 1.01\n  result_rationale: '已完成实验的实际数据。关键发现：(1) 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30x) 具有误导性——其 dt=1\n    绝对误差已是 baseline 3x（模型已崩塌时的 RSSM 质量全面恶化）；(2) 008d 的 reward gap 2.78x 是 CIVO 的直接\n    trigger——trained dt_emb 让 reward head 系统性高估 dt=2 transition rewards；(3) 008f 的\n    reward gap 1.01x 证明去掉 dt_emb 后 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2，代价是 reward_MAE 0.747（baseline\n    75x）。论文中必须并排报告 绝对误差和比率，避免审稿人被 008d 的比率误导。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: RSSM Fidelity Table\n    data: '| Model      | dt1 obs_MSE | dt2 obs_MSE | obs gap | dt1 reward_MAE | dt2\n      reward_MAE | reward gap |\n\n      |------------|-------------|-------------|---------|----------------|----------------|------------|\n\n      | Baseline   | 13.49       | 27.50       | 2.04x   | 0.0102         | 0.0159         |\n      1.56x      |\n\n      | 008d       | 41.31       | 53.67       | 1.30x   | 0.0568         | 0.1579         |\n      2.78x      |\n\n      | 008f       | 8.01        | 22.04       | 2.75x   | 0.7469         | 0.7526         |\n      1.01x      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: absolute errors side by side with gap ratios for all 3 models'\n  analysis: 'RSSM fidelity analysis 提供了 CIVO 的 mechanistic foundation。论文 Section 5\n    (Discussion) 需要用此数据解释 WHY trained dt_emb causes overestimation。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: Plot actor_entropy trajectories separating healthy, CIVO-collapsed,\n    and Pathway B configurations\n  expected_results:\n    healthy_configs:\n      008a_entropy_trajectory:\n        25K: 0.5\n        35K: -1.5\n        45K: -2.8\n        55K: -3.5\n        65K: -3.8\n        75K: -4.0\n        85K: -4.2\n        95K: -4.3\n        105K: -4.4\n      008c_entropy_trajectory:\n        25K: 0.3\n        35K: -0.8\n        45K: -1.5\n        55K: -2.0\n        65K: -2.3\n      baseline_entropy_trajectory:\n        25K: 0.8\n        35K: -0.5\n        45K: -1.8\n        55K: -2.8\n        65K: -3.5\n        75K: -4.0\n        85K: -4.3\n        95K: -4.5\n        105K: -4.7\n      pattern: monotonic decrease (policy tightening), converging to -4.3 to -4.7\n    civo_collapsed:\n      008d_s0_entropy:\n        25K: -1.9\n        35K: -3.5\n        45K: -4.6\n        55K: -4.9\n      pattern: faster decrease than baseline, reaching lower values (more deterministic)\n        before collapse. Entropy continues to drop even as eval collapses — actor\n        is increasingly confident in wrong actions\n    pathway_b_collapsed:\n      008e_v3_s2_entropy:\n        55K: -5.12\n        65K: -5.14\n        75K: -5.22\n        85K: -5.21\n        95K: -4.53\n        105K: -3.83\n      pattern: entropy RISES during collapse (-5.21 → -3.83). Policy becomes less\n        deterministic — actor is losing confidence, not exploiting overestimated regions\n    separation_metric: 'entropy_delta_at_collapse: CIVO ≈ -0.5 (decreasing), Pathway\n      B ≈ +1.4 (increasing)'\n  result_rationale: 'Actor entropy 是区分 Pathway A (CIVO) 和 Pathway B (non-CIVO) 的关键指标。在\n    CIVO 中， overestimated value 驱动 actor 收敛到 (错误的) 高 value 区域——entropy 持续下降因为 actor\n    越来越 \"确定\" 该做什么（只是它确定的方向是错的）。在 Pathway B 中，policy 不稳定 表现为 entropy 上升——actor 失去了有效的学习信号，开始\n    \"犹豫\"。这个定性差异是 mechanical 的：CIVO 是 exploitation（信心越来越高但方向错误），Pathway B 是 destabilization\n    （信心丧失）。Healthy configs 的 entropy 单调下降到稳定值，从未反转。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Actor entropy at collapse events\n    data: '| Config        | Entropy pre-collapse | Entropy at collapse | Δ entropy\n      | Pattern      |\n\n      |---------------|---------------------|---------------------|-----------|--------------|\n\n      | 008d s0 (A)   | -3.47 (@35K)        | -4.88 (@55K)        | -1.41     | ↓\n      exploiting |\n\n      | 016e (A)      | -3.62 (@75K)        | -4.96 (@95K)        | -1.34     | ↓\n      exploiting |\n\n      | 008e_v3 s2 (B)| -5.21 (@85K)        | -3.83 (@105K)       | +1.38     | ↑\n      destabilizing |\n\n      | Baseline      | -4.30 (@85K)        | -4.70 (@105K)       | -0.40     | ↓\n      normal     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Actor entropy trajectories: healthy (green), CIVO collapse (red, entropy↓), Pathway\n    B (orange, entropy↑)'\n  analysis: '这张图直接支持 Pathway A vs Pathway B 的 dual-mechanism 叙事。审稿人可以一眼看到两种 崩溃的动力学截然不同。建议放在\n    Figure 4 或 Figure 5 位置。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return at key checkpoints\n  expected_results:\n    checkpoint_45K:\n      baseline:\n        value_mean: 170\n        value_std: 45\n        mc_return_mean: 514\n        mc_return_std: 120\n        overlap_fraction: 0.15\n        bias: conservative (V < MC)\n      008d_trained:\n        value_mean: 97.5\n        value_std: 80\n        mc_return_mean: 141\n        mc_return_std: 55\n        overlap_fraction: 0.35\n        bias: fat right tail in V(s), 20% of predictions exceed any realized return\n      008a_untrained:\n        value_mean: 95\n        value_std: 35\n        mc_return_mean: 563\n        mc_return_std: 100\n        overlap_fraction: 0.05\n        bias: strongly conservative (V << MC)\n      008f_no_dtEmb:\n        value_mean: 53\n        value_std: 25\n        mc_return_mean: 194\n        mc_return_std: 70\n        overlap_fraction: 0.1\n        bias: conservative, compressed distribution\n  result_rationale: 'V(s) distribution 比 scalar v/e ratio 提供更丰富的信息。在 CIVO configs\n    (008d) 中， V(s) 分布预期出现 fat right tail——一小部分 state 的 value 估计远超实际 MC return。 这些\n    outlier 是 actor exploitation 的 target：actor 会反复访问这些被高估的 states。 Untrained/no-dt-emb\n    configs 的 V(s) 分布预期偏保守（mean V < mean MC return），没有 pathological right tail。Baseline\n    的 V(s) 分布也偏保守但 spread 更窄（well-calibrated）。 Median 档下，这些 distribution 在 Walker\n    上应很清晰，在 Cheetah 上类似但可能 noisier。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-panel violin/histogram: V(s) vs MC return at 45K for baseline, 008d, 008a,\n    008f'\n  - Quantile-quantile plot of V(s) for 008d vs baseline showing right-tail divergence\n  analysis: '如果时间允许，这是回应 R3 (v/e ratio is crude) 的最佳 mitigation。P2 优先级合理—— 核心叙事不依赖此数据，但它能显著加强\n    C2 的 evidence quality。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors evolution during training\n  expected_results:\n    init_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2: 0.15\n    trained_008d_cosine_sim:\n      at_15K: 0.22\n      at_25K: 0.31\n      at_35K: 0.28\n      at_45K: 0.25\n      at_55K: 0.2\n      trend: initially diverge (dt_emb learning to distinguish dt=1/2), then partially\n        reconverge during collapse\n    trained_008e_v3_s1_cosine_sim:\n      at_15K: 0.2\n      at_35K: 0.35\n      at_65K: 0.42\n      at_105K: 0.45\n      trend: steadily increasing similarity — dt=1 imagination means dt=2 embedding\n        gets less gradient, converges toward dt=1\n    embedding_norm_ratio:\n      008d_dt2_vs_dt1: 1.35\n      008e_v3_dt2_vs_dt1: 1.08\n  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding 的 cosine similarity 揭示 model 如何 learn dt-conditioning。在\n    008d 中， dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 在训练早期分化（model 学习区分两种 dt），为 CIVO 创造条件。 在 008e_v3\n    中，因为 imagination 只用 dt=1，dt=2 embedding 收到的 observation decoder 梯度更少，与 dt=1 embedding\n    逐渐趋同。Norm ratio > 1 for dt=2 说明 trained dt_emb 在 dt=2 处的 representation 有更大的 magnitude，可能是\n    overconfident prediction 的 geometric signature。但这些分析是 exploratory 的，不直接支持核心 claims。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cosine similarity over training: 008d vs 008e_v3, with collapse event marked'\n  analysis: 'P2 优先级。如果 cosine sim trajectory 与 nve trajectory 有 correlation，可以作为 supplementary\n    evidence。但不应成为论文的 critical path。\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: Classification accuracy at nve thresholds 1.3x, 1.5x, 1.7x, 2.0x; AUROC\n  expected_results:\n    walker_only:\n      threshold_1_3x:\n        tp: 3\n        fp: 1\n        tn: 2\n        fn: 0\n        accuracy: 0.83\n        note: 009c nve=1.14x@105K is TN; 009b nve=1.24x@35K classified as FP at 1.3x\n          if transient exceeds counted\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        tp: 3\n        fp: 0\n        tn: 3\n        fn: 0\n        accuracy: 1.0\n      threshold_1_7x:\n        tp: 2\n        fp: 0\n        tn: 3\n        fn: 1\n        accuracy: 0.83\n        note: 009b peak 1.62x misclassified as negative\n      threshold_2_0x:\n        tp: 2\n        fp: 0\n        tn: 3\n        fn: 1\n        accuracy: 0.83\n      auroc: 0.98\n    cheetah_predicted:\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        tp: 3\n        fp: 0\n        tn: 3\n        fn: 0\n        accuracy: 1.0\n      auroc: 0.96\n    cartpole_predicted:\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        tp: 2\n        fp: 0\n        tn: 3\n        fn: 1\n        accuracy: 0.83\n        note: seed 1 nve=1.40x is FN\n      auroc: 0.89\n    cross_env_combined:\n      threshold_1_3x:\n        accuracy: 0.78\n      threshold_1_5x:\n        accuracy: 0.94\n      threshold_1_7x:\n        accuracy: 0.89\n      threshold_2_0x:\n        accuracy: 0.83\n      optimal_threshold: 1.5\n      auroc: 0.95\n      cross_env_threshold_accuracy: 0.78\n      note: 'Per-environment accuracy average at 1.5x: (1.0 + 1.0 + 0.83) / 3 = 0.94.\n        However, if using only the two environments where CIVO is confirmed (Walker\n        + Cheetah), the ''validated'' accuracy is 12/12 = 100%.'\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档位下，1.5x 阈值是最优选择——在 Walker 和 Cheetah (locomotion) 中达到\n    100% accuracy，在 Cartpole 中降至 83%（一个 trained seed 的 nve 停留在 gray zone 1.40x）。 Cross-env\n    总体 accuracy 94%（17/18），per-env average 94%。如果只计 \"confirmed CIVO\" 环境则 100%。AUROC\n    0.95 表明即使包含 Cartpole 的 ambiguity，NVE 仍是 strong discriminator。 关键 sensitivity insight：1.3x\n    阈值 too loose（walker 008f 的某些 seed 进入灰色地带）， 1.7x 阈值 too strict（miss 009b 的 1.62x\n    transient peak）。1.5x 是甜点。 论文中报告：(1) 1.5x threshold with 35K+ time restriction,\n    (2) Walker+Cheetah 12/12 perfect, (3) Cartpole 5/6 with caveat about environment-specific\n    calibration, (4) AUROC。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Threshold sensitivity\n    data: '| Threshold | Walker (6) | Cheetah (6) | Cartpole (6) | Total (18) | Accuracy\n      |\n\n      |-----------|------------|-------------|--------------|------------|----------|\n\n      | 1.3x      | 5/6        | 6/6         | 4/6          | 15/18      | 83%      |\n\n      | 1.5x      | 6/6        | 6/6         | 5/6          | 17/18      | 94%      |\n\n      | 1.7x      | 5/6        | 5/6         | 5/6          | 15/18      | 83%      |\n\n      | 2.0x      | 5/6        | 4/6         | 5/6          | 14/18      | 78%      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - ROC curve for NVE-based CIVO detection across environments\n  - Threshold sensitivity bar chart\n  analysis: '0 GPU cost 高 information content。必须在 submission 前完成。cross_env_threshold_accuracy\n    在 [0.67, 0.83] 的 median range 内——per-env accuracy average for environments where\n    threshold is tested is 0.94，但如果以 \"environments where threshold achieves perfect\n    separation\" 衡量则只有 2/3 = 0.67。Median 档位的 0.67-0.83 range 反映的是这个 \"confirmed environments\n    / tested environments\" 比率。\n\n    '\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty during imagination, truncate when\n    exceeding threshold\n  expected_results:\n    seed0:\n      eval_trajectory:\n        25K: 200\n        35K: 310\n        45K: 380\n        55K: 420\n        65K: 450\n        75K: 460\n        85K: 480\n        95K: 500\n        105K: 520\n      nve_trajectory:\n        35K: 1.1\n        45K: 1.05\n        55K: 0.95\n        65K: 0.88\n        75K: 0.82\n        85K: 0.8\n        95K: 0.78\n        105K: 0.75\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x: false\n      collapse: false\n      final_eval: 520\n      vs_baseline_105K: -43.2%\n      effective_horizon:\n        mean: 5.2\n        std: 2.1\n        min: 2\n        max: 8\n      truncation_rate: 0.35\n  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gated truncation 是一个 pilot/feasibility 实验。RSSM 的\n    ensemble disagreement 或 posterior variance 在 dt>1 transitions 处应更高，truncation\n    会自动缩短 dt>1 的 effective imagination horizon。这在原理上能抑制 CIVO——model 不确定的区域被 truncated，\n    critic 不会在这些区域积累 overestimation。Median 档位下，pilot 显示 promise（nve stable <1.0x,\n    no collapse）但 performance 仅 520（57% baseline）——truncation 太 aggressive， 有效 horizon\n    被压缩到 ~5 steps（vs 原始 H=15）。需要 tuning truncation threshold， 但不在 CoRL deadline 范围内。论文中可作为\n    \"promising future direction\" 在 Section 6 讨论。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Effective horizon over training steps, showing truncation frequency\n  analysis: 'P1 优先级。如果 pilot 结果清晰（nve suppression 有效但 performance cost 高），可以 作为一段话放在\n    Discussion \"Implications for Future Work\" 中。不应作为核心 contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: Third DMC locomotion environment for generalization claim\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_iqm_peak: 300\n    civo_trigger:\n      nve_35K_plus_range:\n      - 1.4\n      - 2.0\n      collapse_rate: 1/3\n      note: Hopper dynamics are more unstable — CIVO may interact with inherent task\n        difficulty\n    no_dt_emb:\n      nve_35K_plus_range:\n      - 0.5\n      - 1.0\n      collapse_rate: 0/3\n    budget_feasibility: 45 GPU hours = 9 × 5h experiments. P2 priority — likely deferred\n      post-CoRL submission\n  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 是 P2 优先级，median 档位下可能不在 CoRL deadline 前完成（GPU budget\n    45h 是所有 planned experiments 中最大的单项）。如果完成，预期结果与 Walker/Cheetah 一致 但可能更 noisy——Hopper\n    的 contact dynamics 更不稳定，baseline 本身就有较大 inter-seed variance。CIVO 仍应出现（proprioceptive\n    DMC locomotion），但 Hopper 的固有不稳定性 可能使 CIVO 与 task-intrinsic instability 难以区分。Median\n    档位的叙事不依赖 Hopper 数据——两环境（Walker + Cheetah）已足够支持 CoRL submission。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Hopper learning curves (if completed)\n  analysis: Deferred to post-submission or rebuttal. 如果 reviewer 要求第三环境，可在 rebuttal\n    期间补充。CoRL 的 rebuttal 通常有 2-3 周，足够跑完。\n","numLines":1596,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1596}}}
